art section\n- Add Testing section with test commands and descriptions","tree":{"sha":"837d4904cb805189ddc45c0f5dbe1bc727952e2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arramandhanu/shipctl/git/trees/837d4904cb805189ddc45c0f5dbe1bc727952e2a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arramandhanu/shipctl/git/commits/d35ffb27938dd530eaff4c78d0f9df9432b59282","verification":{"payload":"tree 837d4904cb805189ddc45c0f5dbe1bc727952e2a\nparent 50f727465a5d53f5da74f2bf434451dce2ce901c\nauthor arramandhanu <104307768+arramandhanu@users.noreply.github.com> 1770313039 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1770313039 +0700\n\nFeature/multi orchestration cloud support (#17)\n\n* feat: add multi-orchestration and cloud provider support\n\nAdd orchestrator abstraction layer:\n- lib/orchestrator.sh: Unified interface for orchestrators\n- lib/orchestrators/compose.sh: Docker Compose support (default)\n- lib/orchestrators/swarm.sh: Docker Swarm with stack deploy\n\nAdd cloud provider modules:\n- lib/provider.sh: Unified interface for cloud providers\n- lib/providers/aws.sh: AWS ECR + ECS support\n- lib/providers/gcp.sh: GCP Artifact Registry + Cloud Run\n- lib/providers/azure.sh: Azure ACR + ACI support\n- lib/providers/alibaba.sh: Alibaba Cloud ACR + ECI\n\nAdd new CLI flags:\n- --orchestrator TYPE: compose (default), swarm\n- --provider CLOUD: local (default), aws, gcp, azure, alibaba\n- --stack NAME: Docker Swarm stack name\n- --cluster NAME: Cloud cluster name (ECS/AKS/GKE)\n\nUpdate config template with orchestrator and cloud provider settings.\nUpdate help text with new orchestration and cloud provider sections.\n\n* feat: add multi-orchestration and cloud provider support\n\n* feat: add Kubernetes orchestrator and test suite\n\n- Add lib/orchestrators/kubernetes.sh with kubectl-based deployment\n- Add tests/run_tests.sh for comprehensive module verification\n- Add tests/verify_mocks.sh for mock-based testing\n- Update lib/orchestrator.sh to dispatch to kubernetes orchestrator\n- 