web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mayafit/Contacts/commit/87153365ebcb87a8296a5e6407c1f09a3f855ad5","node_id":"C_kwDOQ6ld1doAKDg3MTUzMzY1ZWJjYjg3YTgyOTZhNWU2NDA3YzFmMDlhM2Y4NTVhZDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mayafit/Contacts/commit/8748d77305709e79e5ab3dad02c58163d6097eeb","sha":"8748d77305709e79e5ab3dad02c58163d6097eeb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mayafit/Contacts/commits/8748d77305709e79e5ab3dad02c58163d6097eeb"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/mayafit/Contacts/commit/3b28d1b0c6cfa876746420a4a69e4e92aa355c6f","sha":"3b28d1b0c6cfa876746420a4a69e4e92aa355c6f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mayafit/Contacts/commits/3b28d1b0c6cfa876746420a4a69e4e92aa355c6f"}],"sha":"87153365ebcb87a8296a5e6407c1f09a3f855ad5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mayafit/Contacts/commits/87153365ebcb87a8296a5e6407c1f09a3f855ad5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mayafit/Contacts/commits/3b28d1b0c6cfa876746420a4a69e4e92aa355c6f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T16:46:54Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude Opus 5 (1M context)"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T16:46:54Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude Opus 5 (1M context)"},"message":"fix(webapi): survive a cold Redis instead of crash-looping\n\nConnectionMultiplexer.Connect() ran with StackExchange.Redis'' default\nAbortOnConnectFail=true, so it threw if Redis was not already accepting\nconnections the moment the process started. Nothing catches it and it runs\nbefore the host is built, so the throw killed the container outright.\n\nIn the 2026-08-31 power outage every workload came back at once. Redis was\nstill starting, and this line had restarted contacts-backend 755 times\nbefore anyone looked -- it only ever recovered by winning a startup race.\nThe surfaced error was a RedisConnectionException pointing here, which also\nburied the real trigger (a sealed Vault upstream) for the whole diagnosis.\n\nNow the connection string is parsed into ConfigurationOptions with\nAbortOnConnectFail=false plus bounded retry, so Connect() returns a\nmultiplexer that reconnects in the background. The distributed-cache\nregistration gets a Clone() of the same options rather than the raw string:\nit opens a second multiplexer, and passing the string would have parsed it\nfresh with the default flag restored, reintroducing the same crash one\nconnection over.\n\nVerified by running the API with Redis pointed at a dead port:\n  - before: \"Unhandled exception. StackExchange.Redis.\n    RedisConnectionException\" and immediate exit\n  - after:  no unhandled exception, process stays up, binds and answers\n    HTTP within ~20s while Redis stays unreachable\n\nRedis remains a hard dependency for sessions and Data Protection key\npersistence -- the key ring logs a read error while it is down. The point is\nthat degradation is now recoverable without a restart, not that Redis is\noptional.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d49682ca0bb6a61168b1db10bfcae660439c312b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mayafit/Contacts/git/trees/d49682ca0bb6a61168b1db10bfcae660439c312b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mayafit/Contacts/git/commits/3b28d1b0c6cfa876746420a4a69e4e92aa355c6f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mayafit/Contacts/commit/3b28d1b0c6cfa876746420a4a69e4e92aa355c6f","node_id":"C_kwDOQ6ld1doAKDNiMjhkMWIwYzZjZmE4NzY3NDY0MjBhNGE2OWU0ZTkyYWEzNTVjNmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mayafit/Contacts/commit/8748d77305709e79e5ab3dad02c58163d6097eeb","sha":"8748d77305709e79e5ab3dad02c58163d6097eeb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mayafit/Contacts/commits/8748d77305709e79e5ab3dad02c58163d6097eeb"}],"sha":"3b28d1b0c6cfa876746420a4a69e4e92aa355c6f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mayafit/Contacts/commits/3b28d1b0c6cfa876746420a4a69e4e92aa355c6f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26208005?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/events{/privacy}","follow