criptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mayafit/Contacts/commits/b767293ce0b94a7777f2db3da4964d464bb28d6f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-02T15:24:42Z","email":"alon.mayafit@gmail.com","name":"Alon Mayaffit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-02T15:24:42Z","email":"alon.mayafit@gmail.com","name":"Alon Mayaffit"},"message":"test(columnConfig): add localStorage persistence integration tests\n\nAdd integration tests to verify localStorage persistence flow in uiSlice:\n- Test initial state structure with column configuration\n- Verify correct storage key constant (''contacts:columnConfig'')\n- Test that column config structure is maintained through all reducers\n\nThese tests verify the integration contract between uiSlice and\ncolumnConfigStorage without attempting to mock ES module initialization,\nwhich is problematic in Jest. The actual load/save behavior is tested\nin columnConfigStorage.test.ts with 100% coverage.\n\nTests verify acceptance criteria from Story 2.7:\n- Storage key matches specification\n- Column config structure is valid for persistence\n- Initial state properly integrates with storage utility\n\nAll 17 tests passing (14 existing + 3 new integration tests).\n\nImplements Story 2.7 Task 6: Add integration tests for persistence flow\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e3e40992ea065d45c92dc2d6b2adfc79d11228b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mayafit/Contacts/git/trees/e3e40992ea065d45c92dc2d6b2adfc79d11228b7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mayafit/Contacts/git/commits/b767293ce0b94a7777f2db3da4964d464bb28d6f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26208005?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/events{/privacy}","followers_url