ttps://api.github.com/users/mayafit/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mayafit/Contacts/commits/643376f2eee433f2d88eaa84ce931129963229af/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-02T15:21:53Z","email":"alon.mayafit@gmail.com","name":"Alon Mayaffit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-02T15:21:53Z","email":"alon.mayafit@gmail.com","name":"Alon Mayaffit"},"message":"feat(columnConfig): add Redux middleware for localStorage persistence\n\nImplement automatic persistence of column configuration changes to localStorage\nthrough Redux middleware pattern. Middleware intercepts column config actions\nand saves state synchronously after reducer updates.\n\nChanges:\n- Add columnConfigPersistenceMiddleware to intercept ui/setColumnConfig,\n  ui/toggleColumn, ui/reorderColumns, and ui/resetColumnConfig actions\n- Extend Redux store configuration to support dynamic middleware registration\n- Add addMiddleware() function to configureStore.ts with userMiddlewares array\n- Register middleware in PluginWrapper.tsx at module load time (before store init)\n- Update GLOBALS.ts to expose addMiddleware globally\n- Update InitComp.tsx to pass addMiddleware through shared props\n- Update uiSlice.ts to load persisted config from localStorage on initialization\n- Remove redundant middleware registration from contacts.entry.ts\n\nTechnical details:\n- Middleware runs AFTER reducer updates state to ensure correct data is saved\n- Registration timing is critical: must happen before store initialization\n- Error handling: localStorage failures are logged but don''t break Redux flow\n- Structured logging with context and metadata on all operations\n\nImplements Story 2.7 Tasks 3-4:\n- Task 3: Update Redux UI slice to persist on changes\n- Task 4: Load initial column config from localStorage\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6828eaba69a58001b3408988baadb535a669ccc6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mayafit/Contacts/git/trees/6828eaba69a58001b3408988baadb535a669ccc6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mayafit/Contacts/git/commits/643376f2eee433f2d88eaa84ce931129963229af","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26208005?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mayafit","id":26208005,"login":"mayafit","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MjA4MDA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mayafit/Contacts/commit/643376f2eee433f2d88eaa84ce931129963229af","node_id":"C_kwDOQ6ld1doAKDY0MzM3NmYyZWVlNDMzZjJkODhlYWE4NGNlOTMxMTI5OTYzMjI5YWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mayafit/Contacts/commit/772b16eeec701d603be77b32376207eec563fbb3","sha":"772b16eeec701d603be77b32376207eec563fbb3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mayafit/Contacts/commits/772b16eeec701d603be77b32376207eec563fbb3"}],"sha":"643376f2eee433f2d88eaa84ce931129963229af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mayafit/Contacts/commi