afit/Contacts/commits/adf7d487d4c489dadf7e6038e2b9f0a95a4c6627/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-31T10:52:27Z","email":"alon.mayafit@gmail.com","name":"Alon Mayaffit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-31T10:52:27Z","email":"alon.mayafit@gmail.com","name":"Alon Mayaffit"},"message":"fix(contacts): implement pagination loop to fetch all contacts\n\nPreviously only fetched first 1000 contacts from backend API.\nNow loops through all pages using nextPageToken until all contacts\nare retrieved.\n\nChanges:\n- Add pagination loop in fetchAllContacts method\n- Track pageCount and totalContacts in logs\n- Add debug logging for each page fetch\n- Continue fetching until nextPageToken is null/undefined\n\nFixes issue where users with >1000 contacts only saw first page.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9556f25e10bd0c05db6f53c5cbe1da9c25ddaae5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mayafit/Contacts/git/trees/9556f25e10bd0c05db6f53c5cbe1da9c25ddaae5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mayafit/Contacts/git/commits/adf7d487d4c489dadf7e6038e2b9f0a95a4c6627","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26208005?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mayafit","id":26208005,"login":"mayafit","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MjA4MDA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mayafit/Contacts/commit/adf7d487d4c489dadf7e6038e2b9f0a95a4c6627","node_id":"C_kwDOQ6ld1doAKGFkZjdkNDg3ZDRjNDg5ZGFkZjdlNjAzOGUyYjlmMGE5NWE0YzY2Mjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mayafit/Contacts/commit/c7aa7905c3b37605814782c03831059e85551fd4","sha":"c7aa7905c3b37605814782c03831059e85551fd4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mayafit/Contacts/commits/c7aa7905c3b37605814782c03831059e85551fd4"}],"sha":"adf7d487d4c489dadf7e6038e2b9f0a95a4c6627","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mayafit/Contacts/commits/adf7d487d4c489dadf7e6038e2b9f0a95a4c6627"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26208005?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mayafit","id":26208005,"login":"mayafit","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MjA4MDA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mayafit/Contacts/commits/c7aa7905c3b37605814782c03831059e85551fd4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-31T10:38:28Z","email":"alon.mayafit@gmail.com","name":"Alon Mayaffit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-31T10:38:28Z","email":"alon.mayafit@gmail.com","name":"Alon Mayaffit"},"message":"feat(redux): implement normalized contacts state with entity adapter\n\nStory 2.2: Implement Contacts Redux Slice with Normalized State\n\n- Create contactsSlice with EntityAdapter for O(1) lookups\n- Implement normalized state structure (entities/ids pattern)\n- Add async thunks for fetchContacts and updateContact\n- Create memoized selectors for efficient state access\n- Add comprehensive unit tests for reducer logic (8/8 passing)\n- Update ContactsTable to use Redux instead of local state\n- Add FETCH_FAILED and UPDATE_FAILED error codes\n- Update store type definitions for ContactsState\n\nTechnical details:\n- Uses createEntityAdapter<Contact, string> with resourceName as ID\n- Automatic sorting by display name via sortComparer\n- Memoized selectors prevent unnecessary re-renders\n- Type-safe with no ''any'' types throughout\n- Preserves referential equality for unchanged contacts\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4c143cb02082dbe24c9646e0ba3dc2963ef88cf6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mayafit/Contacts/git/trees/4c143cb02082dbe24c9646e0ba3dc2963ef88cf6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mayafit/Contacts/git/commits/c7aa7905c3b37605814782c03831059e85551fd4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26208005?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mayafit","id":26208005,"login":"mayafit","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MjA4MDA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/recei