rs/mayafit/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mayafit/Contacts/commit/7f5c19aa62c144b351a79a81f01eb3249625b9e8","node_id":"C_kwDOQ6ld1doAKDdmNWMxOWFhNjJjMTQ0YjM1MWE3OWE4MWYwMWViMzI0OTYyNWI5ZTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mayafit/Contacts/commit/435e7f531b6af9437a01698f91da2c3f5aebef14","sha":"435e7f531b6af9437a01698f91da2c3f5aebef14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mayafit/Contacts/commits/435e7f531b6af9437a01698f91da2c3f5aebef14"}],"sha":"7f5c19aa62c144b351a79a81f01eb3249625b9e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mayafit/Contacts/commits/7f5c19aa62c144b351a79a81f01eb3249625b9e8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26208005?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mayafit","id":26208005,"login":"mayafit","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MjA4MDA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mayafit/Contacts/commits/435e7f531b6af9437a01698f91da2c3f5aebef14/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-30T22:48:09Z","email":"alon.mayafit@gmail.com","name":"Alon Mayaffit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-30T22:48:09Z","email":"alon.mayafit@gmail.com","name":"Alon Mayaffit"},"message":"feat(backend): add C# ASP.NET Core backend API to monorepo\n\nStory 2-3: Backend API Integration\n\nBackend Architecture:\n- ASP.NET Core 9.0 Web API with clean architecture (Core, Infrastructure, WebApi layers)\n- Google OAuth 2.0 Authorization Code Flow with server-side token management\n- Session-based authentication with Redis distributed cache\n- PostgreSQL database for persistent storage\n- HashiCorp Vault integration for secret management\n\nKey Features:\n- AuthController: OAuth login, callback, status check, logout endpoints\n- ContactsController: Proxy to Google People API for contacts CRUD\n- Session Management: HttpOnly cookies with cross-port support (localhost domain)\n- Data Protection: Keys persisted to Redis for session cookie encryption\n- Explicit session commits before OAuth redirects to ensure persistence\n\nSession Configuration:\n- Cookie domain: \"localhost\" (allows sharing between ports 5000 and 3002)\n- HttpOnly: true (prevents JavaScript access)\n- SameSite: Lax (allows OAuth redirects while maintaining CSRF protection)\n- IdleTimeout: 7 days\n- Session storage: Redis distributed cache\n\nInfrastructure:\n- Serilog for structured JSON logging\n- CORS configured for frontend (localhost:3002)\n- Swagger UI for API documentation\n- Docker containerization with Dockerfile\n- Multi-service deployment (backend, PostgreSQL, Redis, Vault)\n\nSecurity:\n- Tokens never exposed to frontend (server-side only)\n- Access tokens stored in session (Redis)\n- Refresh tokens encrypted and stored securely\n- Session cookies with proper security attributes\n\nProject Structure:\n- ContactsApi.Core: Domain entities, interfaces, services\n- ContactsApi.Infrastructure: Google API client, data access, caching\n- ContactsApi.WebApi: Controllers, middleware, configuration\n\nThis commit adds the complete backend to the monorepo as per the\narchitecture plan, enabling secure OAuth authentication and contacts\nmanagement through a dedicated API layer.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"aa75edb0fdc78f8b3b3d0c61bb425fa08848e519","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mayafit/Contacts/git/trees/aa75edb0fdc78f8b3b3d0c61bb425fa08848e519"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mayafit/Contacts/git/commits/435e7f531b6af9437a01698f91da2c3f5aebef14","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26208005?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mayafit","id":26208005,"login":"mayafit","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MjA4MDA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mayafit/Contacts/commit/435e7f531b6af9437a01698f91da2c3f5aebef14","node_id":"C_kwDOQ6ld1doAKDQzNWU3ZjUzMWI2YWY5NDM3YTAxNjk4ZjkxZGEyYzNmNWFlYmVmMTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mayafit/Contacts/commit/27a79a65a1899a23deec1b67b5eb602195affa63","sha":"27a79a65a1899a23deec1b67b5eb602195affa63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mayafit/Contacts/commits/27a79a65a1899a23deec1b67b5eb602195affa63"}],"sha":"435e7f531b6af9437a01698f91da2c3f5aebef14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mayafit/Contacts/commits/435e7f531b6af9437a01698f91da2c3f5aebef14"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26208005?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mayafit","id":26208005,"login":"mayafit","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MjA4MDA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mayafit/Contacts/commits/27a79a65a1899a23deec1b67b5eb602195affa63/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-30T22:34:01Z","email":"alon.mayafit@gmail.com","name":"Alon Mayaffit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-30T22:34:01Z","email":"alon.mayafit@gmail.com","name":"Alon Mayaffit"},"message":"feat(contacts): implement contacts display with backend OAuth integration\n\nStory 2-3: Fetch and Display Contacts\n\nFrontend Changes:\n- Add ContactsTable component to display Google contacts in table format\n- Add comprehensive tests for ContactsTable component\n- Implement BackendApiClient to communicate with C# ASP.NET backend API\n- Update ContactsApp with loading state to prevent auth race conditions\n- Add diagnostic logging to auth flow (ContactsApp, authSlice, ProtectedRoute)\n- Update GoogleContactsService to use backend API instead of direct Google API calls\n- Remove PeopleAPIClient (replaced with backend integration)\n- Remove authInterceptor (token management now server-side)\n- Update LoginPage to redirect to backend OAuth flow\n\nInfrastructure Changes:\n- Update nginx.conf with CSP headers to allow backend API calls\n- Update Docker configuration for multi-service deployment\n- Update .env.example with REACT_APP_API_BASE_URL\n\nAuthentication Flow:\n- Implement cookie-based session authentication with backend\n- Add loading screen to wait for auth check before rendering routes\n- Fix race condition where ProtectedRoute checked auth before async call completed\n\nTesting:\n- All existing tests pass\n- New ContactsTable tests added with 100% coverage\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fe0a9d3c220264e3fc7adcda3db2e0607d085e1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mayafit/Contacts/git/trees/fe0a9d3c220264e3fc7adcda3db2e0607d085e1e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mayafit/Contacts/git/commits/27a79a65a1899a23deec1b67b5eb602195affa63","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26208005?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mayafit","id":26208005,"login":"mayafit","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MjA4MDA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayafit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.gi