h login flow\n\nFIXES:\n- Issue #1: Document testing requirements (deferred to Story 1.8)\n- Issue #2: Replace console.error with structured logger (CLAUDE.md compliance)\n- Issue #3: Create .env file with OAuth Client ID (app can now run)\n- Issue #4: ProtectedRoute clears expired tokens before redirect\n- Issue #5: AuthCallback improved with OAuth error handling and logging\n- Issue #6: Add JWT validation (issuer, audience, expiry, structure)\n- Issue #7: Document scope limitation in GoogleLogin component\n\nCREATED:\n- src/shared/logger.ts: Structured JSON logger with OpenTelemetry support\n- TESTING_TODO.md: Comprehensive testing requirements for Story 1.8\n- src/entries/Contacts/redux/slices/auth/__tests__/authSlice.test.ts: Basic test template\n- .env: Environment configuration with OAuth Client ID\n\nMODIFIED:\n- ContactsApp.tsx: Use logger instead of console.error\n- LoginPage.tsx: Use logger, remove unsupported scope prop\n- authSlice.ts: Add comprehensive JWT validation (structure, issuer, audience, expiry)\n- ProtectedRoute.tsx: Clear expired tokens via logout action\n- AuthCallback.tsx: Add OAuth error detection and user feedback\n\nCODE QUALITY:\n- TypeScript: Zero errors (npx tsc --noEmit)\n- ESLint: All files pass\n- Prettier: All files formatted\n- Webpack: Successful compilation\n\nTESTING STATUS:\n- Comprehensive tests deferred to Story 1.8 per project workflow\n- Story 1.8 explicitly establishes testing infrastructure\n- TESTING_TODO.md documents 5 required test files with test cases\n\nSECURITY IMPROVEMENTS:\n- JWT validation: issuer, audience, expiry, structure\n- Structured logging: No sensitive data in logs\n- Token cleanup: Expired tokens cleared properly\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"afa4726c1fee58ff3ba14887996a0246a3d72753","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mayafit/Contacts/git/trees/afa4726c1fee58ff3ba14887996a0246a3d72753"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mayafit/Contacts/git/commits/e6