,"sha":"87556253e2da2c3ffcea716d8205282bd813e84e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/87556253e2da2c3ffcea716d8205282bd813e84e"}],"sha":"04a9b7405be6de4ae363050a0a86da1aaeafb6ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/04a9b7405be6de4ae363050a0a86da1aaeafb6ea"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/87556253e2da2c3ffcea716d8205282bd813e84e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T22:18:30Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T22:26:39Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"docs: drop stale private-repo framing; repo is public, data off-git\n\npurefoy is a public repo, but the docs still asserted it ''MUST be PRIVATE''\nand — more dangerously — that scraped forum data in library/ was *tracked in\ngit for a private repo*. Verified false: 0 files tracked under library/,\ndownloads/, or analysis/ (all gitignored). No data is or was exposed; the\n''tracked for private repo'' docs were aspirational/never executed.\n\nCorrect all of them to the actual model — **public repo, scraped data kept\noff-git via .gitignore**:\n- CLAUDE.md: keep-private bullet -> ''scraped data stays off-git''\n- README.md: ''MUST be PRIVATE'' section -> Git Data Policy; library/ moved\n  from ''tracked'' to ''gitignored''\n- PROJECT_STRUCTURE.md: library/ ''(TRACKED for private repo)'' -> gitignored\n- GIT_READY.md: ''Recommended: Private'' -> ''Adopted: Public, code only''\n- GIT_INIT_CHECKLIST.md: removed forum-data-as-tracked; flipped the\n  verify-tracked command to verify-NOT-tracked; fixed summary\n- PROJECT_STATUS.md: ''Forum data INCLUDED/tracked'' -> excluded/gitignored;\n  removed ''Keep PRIVATE'' directives\n- ROADMAP.md: 4.6 Public-vs-Private decision -> RESOLVED (public, code only)\n\nFair-use / copyright / rate-limit guidance retained.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9f55a43863d47f6eb7d9141193cc8f1bbaa181b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/trees/9f55a43863d47f6eb7d9141193cc8f1bbaa181b6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/commits/87556253e2da2c3ffcea716d8205282bd813e84e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"ht