com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/3dffd14be517166bf4b717010acdcf35be77dbca/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-11T01:41:06Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-11T01:50:36Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"fix: pin torch/torchaudio <2.11 for DLAMI cuDNN 9.10 compatibility\n\nUnpinned `pip install faster-whisper` started resolving torch 2.11.0+cu130\n(compiled against cuDNN 9.19) on fresh DLAMI instances. The DLAMI AMI ships\ncuDNN 9.10.2, which is compatible with torch 2.10 but not 2.11. This caused\ndiarization to fail silently on all new transcription runs after April 2026.\n\nChanges:\n- Pin torch>=2.10.0,<2.11 and torchaudio>=2.10.0,<2.11 in both\n  requirements-transcription.txt and aws_runner.py setup\n- Always warm the whisper model during setup (prevents silent download\n  hangs during transcription)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b2dd07b5d96ccb8398e498fe2ede7ab414a51abb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/trees/b2dd07b5d96ccb8398e498fe2ede7ab414a51abb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/commits/3dffd14be517166bf4b717010acdcf35be77dbca","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/recei