ame":"ojfbot"},"message":"chore: deploy bead hooks and session coordination\n\n- Add bead coordination hook symlinks from core (_lib.sh, bead-emit.mjs,\n  bead-session.sh, lint-after-edit.sh, lint-before-edit.sh, log-session.sh,\n  log-tool-use.sh, scan-after-write.sh)\n- Hooks enable session bead tracking: skill invocations → session beads,\n  git commits → task beads, PRs → PR beads\n- All hooks gracefully degrade when Dolt is unreachable (silent exit)\n\nDeployed by core/scripts/install-agents.sh purefoy --force\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f331e1e23ea204659c3fb3f7cd76714e09ea3811","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/trees/f331e1e23ea204659c3fb3f7cd76714e09ea3811"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/commits/c3ace5b93b3de256a1735db66a629a4814f32e81","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/purefoy/commit/c3ace5b93b3de256a1735db66a629a4814f32e81","node_id":"C_kwDOQ6l9Hd