sers.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"fix(ui): replace season carousels with profession grouping, hide Forum tab\n\nSeason-based grouping was ineffective: Season 2 had 185 episodes in one\ncarousel, and a data bug created a bogus \"Season 86\". Topic carousels\nwere also useless (100% overlap across episodes).\n\nNew carousel structure:\n- Recently Added (30 newest)\n- Guest profession groups (Cinematographers, Directors, Production\n  Designers, etc.) extracted from title \"NAME - Role\" format\n- By year (2020–2026)\n- Top discussed films (3+ episode references)\n\nForum tab is now conditionally rendered server-side via has_forum flag.\nHidden in production (CDN mode, no local forum data) but still available\nin local dev with filesystem access.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ea35cbe6ca3f2ea7633fccc2f5997c7e8239b987","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/trees/ea35cbe6ca3f2ea7633fccc2f5997c7e8239b987"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/commits/2908ed04e1061012bb645fe33efa3d78961a5068","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.git