410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-31T02:56:42Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"fix: align template with camelCase PaginatedResponse API\n\nThe Flask API was updated to return PaginatedResponse envelopes with\ncamelCase keys (ADR-010), but the Jinja template still expected flat\narrays with snake_case fields — resulting in a blank episode list.\n\n- Unwrap PaginatedResponse `.items` in bootstrap fetch\n- Add `_normalize()` to map camelCase API fields to template names\n- Fetch episode detail endpoint for description in modal\n- Handle chapters response as `{chapters:[]}` dict, not flat array\n- Raise pagination limit cap from 100 to 500\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e4361690c388e47db254c302603655e7608c6dff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/trees/e4361690c388e47db254c302603655e7608c6dff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/commits/1b61bbec29ab7a94b64dbfd08775ad87d7469d88","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/us