atar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/8c105bbe4ce9b3f2eafd0b2278539f2bdd840778/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-23T02:10:18Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-23T03:12:54Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"docs: update data-store-and-tooling — 348/348 transcribed, corpus stats\n\nAll 348 episodes are now transcribed (S02E185 Malgosia Turzanska added\n2026-03-18). Speaker embedding gaps reduced from ~65 to ~11 after\ndiscovering the embed-only re-run fixed most episodes; re-embed batch\ncompleted 2026-03-18.\n\n- Episode count: 347 → 348, all complete\n- Corpus stats updated: ~837 hrs, ~830k segments, ~8.76M words, ~18.8k chapters\n- Known issues: remove \"57 in progress\", update embedding gap ~65 → ~11\n- §2i: note re-embed batch completed 2026-03-18\n- §5: remove resolved \"57 not transcribed\" row\n- §6: note all 348 transcribed, B3 pass can begin\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4dcaccbc8d707afe717ddab7848d588ab2932f53","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/trees/4dcaccbc8d707afe717ddab7848d588ab2932f53"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/commits/8c105bbe4ce9b3f2eafd0b2278539f2bdd840778","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":fal