nizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/52b59ee84fa30403e90275cbeaec956f08a87196/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-23T02:10:08Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-23T03:12:54Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"fix(aws_runner): discover episodes with missing speaker embeddings\n\n--embed-speakers passed to discover_episodes() was silently ignored —\nthe parameter didn''t exist, so episodes with successful diarization but\nempty speaker_embeddings/ were never re-queued.\n\nChanges:\n- Add _latest_dz_run_has_embeddings() helper: checks the most recent __dz\n  run for non-empty speaker_embeddings/*.npy files\n- Add embed_speakers param to discover_episodes(): re-queues episodes\n  where diarization succeeded (speakers_detected > 0) but .npy files are\n  missing — works both when --diarize is co-present and standalone\n- Thread embed_speakers through the full-mode discover call in main()\n- Fix log message: \"undiarized re-runs\" → \"force re-runs\" (covers both\n  undiarized and missing-embedding cases)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"470680bdd9b39efd71e2beb9a1a390b71f43f0da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/trees/470680bdd9b39efd71e2beb9a1a390b71f43f0da"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/commits/52b59ee84fa30403e90275cbeaec956f08a87196","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/purefoy/commit/52b59ee84fa30403e90275cbeaec956f08a87196","node_id":"C_kwDOQ6l9HdoAKDUyYjU5ZWU4NGZhMzA0MDNlOTAyNzVjYmVhZWM5NTZmMDhhODcxOTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/purefoy/commit/d2861ea5168dde577c7be7c2234174929e7d4587","sha":"d2861ea5168dde577c7be7c2234174929e7d4587","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/d2861ea5168dde577c7be7c2234174929e7d4587"}],"sha":"52b59ee84fa30403e90275cbeaec956f08a87196","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/52b59ee84fa30403e90275cbeaec956f08a87196"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/d2861ea5168dde577c7be7c2234174929e7d4587/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-23T02:09:59Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-23T03:12:54Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"fix(aws_runner): harden ffmpeg install on fresh DLAMI instances\n\napt-get install fails on fresh EC2 instances without apt-get update first\n(\"Unable to locate package ffmpeg\"). Also, the old pipe to tail -3 masked\nthe exit code (tail always exits 0).\n\nChanges:\n- Run apt-get update -qq before install, with 300s DPkg lock timeout to\n  survive unattended-upgrades lock contention\n- Verify ffmpeg is present after install with `which ffmpeg` (raises if not)\n- Capture actual binary directory (may be conda bin on DLAMI, not /usr/bin)\n- Store in RemoteWorker.ffmpeg_dir and prepend to nohup PATH so the\n  detached transcription process finds ffmpeg regardless of conda layout\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"38fab78bbd18825be7415443594c0218f03509f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/trees/38fab78bbd18825be7415443594c0218f03509f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/commits/d2861ea5168dde577c7be7c2234174929e7d4587","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/purefoy/commit/d2861ea5168dde577c7be7c2234174929e7d4587","node_id":"C_kwDOQ6l9HdoAKGQyODYxZWE1MTY4ZGRlNTc3YzdiZTdjMjIzNDE3NDkyOWU3ZDQ1ODc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/purefoy/commit/1e0506301e646d78b42669f5ef7a0a44c5da3b04","sha":"1e0506301e646d78b42669f5ef7a0a44c5da3b04","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/1e0506301e646d78b42669f5ef7a0a44c5da3b04"}],"sha":"d2861ea5168dde577c7be7c2234174929e7d4587","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/d2861ea5168dde577c7be7c2234174929e7d4587"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/1e0506301e646d78b42669f5ef7a0a44c5da3b04/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-18T01:48:31Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-23T03:12:54Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"fix: add swap setup to instance provisioning to prevent OOM on ECAPA load\n\ng4dn.xlarge (16 GB RAM) is OOM-killed during ECAPA speaker embedding load\nbecause the process peaks at ~14.5 GB anon-RSS — whisper model + pyannote\nresults + full episode waveform all live simultaneously in RAM.\n\nAdd a 16 GB swapfile as part of the one-time instance setup() step so\nsubsequent runs have headroom without needing manual intervention. The step\nis idempotent (checks swapon --show before re-creating).\n\nDiscovered during batch-2 targeted run (2026-03-17): 3/6 episodes OOM-killed\nbefore swap was added manually; 3/6 succeeded with swap in place.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"90807475ae08384276d03ece20c26443e96f84d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/trees/90807475ae08384276d03ece20c26443e96f84d3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/commits/1e0506301e646d78b42669f5ef7a0a44c5da3b04","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/purefoy/commit/1e0506301e646d78b42669f5ef7a0a44c5da3b04","node_id":"C_kwDOQ6l9HdoAKDFlMDUwNjMwMWU2NDZkNzhiNDI2NjlmNWVmN2EwYTQ0YzVkYTNiMDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/purefoy/commit/2229bf0bacbd13b84aefadf3ddf003127a4cbc5b","sha":"2229bf0bacbd13b84aefadf3ddf003127a4cbc5b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/2229bf0bacbd13b84aefadf3ddf003127a4cbc5b"}],"sha":"1e0506301e646d78b42669f5ef7a0a44c5da3b04","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/1e0506301e646d78b42669f5ef7a0a44c5da3b04"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/2229bf0bacbd13b84aefadf3ddf003127a4cbc5b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-18T00:51:27Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-23T03:12:54Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"fix: set explicit PATH in detached nohup shell on remote EC2\n\nnohup sh -c runs a non-interactive, non-login shell whose PATH does not\nreliably include /usr/bin (where apt installs ffmpeg). All 6 episodes in\nthe first targeted batch failed immediately with ''ffmpeg not found on PATH''\ndespite the setup step confirming ffmpeg was installed.\n\nFix: prepend PATH=/usr/local/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin:/sbin:/bin\nto the env_prefix of every detached remote command instead of relying on the\nshell to inherit a working PATH.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8b551dbcb1a39079ce1e04c7f4833d408e79791d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/trees/8b551dbcb1a39079ce1e04c7f4833d408e79791d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/commits/2229bf0bacbd13b84aefadf3ddf003127a4cbc5b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/purefoy/commit/2229bf0bacbd13b84aefadf3ddf003127a4cbc5b","node_id":"C_kwDOQ6l9HdoAKDIyMjliZjBiYWNiZDEzYjg0YWVmYWRmM2RkZjAwMzEyN2E0Y2JjNWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/purefoy/commit/46bebf0603e3ea926d17ac386ca0bf990076be6d","sha":"46bebf0603e3ea926d17ac386ca0bf990076be6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/46bebf0603e3ea926d17ac386ca0bf990076be6d"}],"sha":"2229bf0bacbd13b84aefadf3ddf003127a4cbc5b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/2229bf0bacbd13b84aefadf3ddf003127a4cbc5b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/ccb6f2afa575dccb62bc7cb2f3b597e91652cf02/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-23T02:47:46Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-23T02:47:46Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"feat(ui): TranscriptViewer — full editing, goal data, review tracking\n\nMajor rewrite of TranscriptViewer.tsx to match Flask reference implementation.\nEpisodeDetail.tsx gains Goal badge. TranscriptEditor.css provides all styles.\n\nConversation view (read mode):\n  - Segments grouped into consecutive same-speaker \"turns\"\n  - Each turn: color-coded left border, speaker label, timestamp, merged text\n  - Click turn → enters edit mode at that segment\n  - Speaker color palette: SPEAKER_00 rose / 01 blue / 02 teal / 03 gold\n\nToolbar (always visible when open):\n  - Original/Goal toggle (only shown when hasGoal=true)\n  - Edit/Editing button\n  - Save as Goal Data (disabled when !isDirty; shows saving spinner)\n  - Discard (only shown when isDirty)\n  - Edit stats: \"N speaker · M text · P split\"\n  - Review %: \"NN% reviewed\" (edit mode only)\n\nEdit mode:\n  - 3-column segment grid: time | speaker dropdown | text cell\n  - Speaker dropdown: all current speakers + \"Add speaker…\" (prompts for name)\n  - Text cell default: word spans with hover-visible split buttons `|`\n    - Click `|` marks split position (highlighted gold)\n    - \"Split (N)\" confirm button → opens SplitDialog inline below segment\n    - SplitDialog: one row per piece, textarea pre-filled, speaker select; Confirm/Cancel\n  - Pencil icon → toggles full textarea editing\n  - Modified segments: yellow left border\n  - Reviewed segments: green right border (subtle)\n\nReview tracking:\n  - IntersectionObserver (60% visibility threshold): marks segments reviewed\n    after 400ms continuous visibility\n  - Debounced flushReview dispatch every 5s during edit mode (clears on exit)\n  - Progress bar at top of edit mode\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d23a19fe5fe669d8f8b3c31e0383cc8209267888","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/trees/d23a19fe5fe669d8f8b3c31e0383cc8209267888"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/commits/ccb6f2afa575dccb62bc7cb2f3b597e91652cf02","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/purefoy/commit/ccb6f2afa575dccb62bc7cb2f3b597e91652cf02","node_id":"C_kwDOQ6l9HdoAKGNjYjZmMmFmYTU3NWRjY2I2MmJjN2NiMmYzYjU5N2U5MTY1MmNmMDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/purefoy/commit/8a031aea5630f7f02ade55d18731f9bef1339271","sha":"8a031aea5630f7f02ade55d18731f9bef1339271","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/8a031aea5630f7f02ade55d18731f9bef1339271"}],"sha":"ccb6f2afa575dccb62bc7cb2f3b597e91652cf02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/ccb6f2afa575dccb62bc7cb2f3b597e91652cf02"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/8a031aea5630f7f02ade55d18731f9bef1339271/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-23T02:45:50Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-23T02:45:50Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"feat(store): transcriptSlice — editing, goal data, review tracking state\n\nNew Redux slice with complete state for the transcript editing workflow:\n\nState:\n  originalSegments / goalSegments / editSegments — three sources\n  viewingGoal / isEditing / isDirty — UI mode flags\n  speakerOrder[] — derived from segments by first-appearance order\n  reviewedSegs[] + reviewCoverage — per-segment human review tracking\n  goalMeta — GoalManifest returned by POST /transcript/goal\n  loadStatus / saveStatus — async state\n\nThunks:\n  loadTranscript(slug)    — stream original NDJSON\n  loadGoalIfExists(slug)  — stream goal NDJSON; 404 = silently empty\n  saveGoalData(slug)      — POST editSegments, update goalSegments + manifest\n  flushReview(slug)       — debounced POST of reviewedSegs\n\nSynchronous actions:\n  setSlug / enterEditMode / exitEditMode / discardEdits / toggleSource\n  updateSpeaker(id, speaker) / updateText(id, text)\n  splitSegment(id, splitPositions, speakerAssignments) — splits one segment\n    into N pieces, distributing time proportionally by word count\n  markReviewed(ids[]) — unions into reviewedSegs\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"be4c4c446bd23c44e499b9cbac1db09d64812e35","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/trees/be4c4c446bd23c44e499b9cbac1db09d64812e35"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/commits/8a031aea5630f7f02ade55d18731f9bef1339271","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/purefoy/commit/8a031aea5630f7f02ade55d18731f9bef1339271","node_id":"C_kwDOQ6l9HdoAKDhhMDMxYWVhNTYzMGY3ZjAyYWRlNTVkMTg3MzFmOWJlZjEzMzkyNzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/purefoy/commit/8134e84ed827b5c5884b61ad0653bd57f119ed2b","sha":"8134e84ed827b5c5884b61ad0653bd57f119ed2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/8134e84ed827b5c5884b61ad0653bd57f119ed2b"}],"sha":"8a031aea5630f7f02ade55d18731f9bef1339271","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/8a031aea5630f7f02ade55d18731f9bef1339271"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/8134e84ed827b5c5884b61ad0653bd57f119ed2b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-23T02:45:39Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-23T02:45:39Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"feat(client): transcript goal + review API methods\n\nAdds five methods to episodesApi:\n  transcriptGoalStream(slug)           — fetch raw Response for NDJSON streaming\n  transcriptGoalMeta(slug)             — GET goal_manifest.json\n  saveGoal(slug, segments)             — POST segments, returns GoalManifest\n  getReview(slug)                      — GET review_progress.json\n  updateReview(slug, reviewed, total)  — POST reviewed segment IDs\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f748b5284901ec0c9a24c4ee7f573982aabdc8d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/trees/f748b5284901ec0c9a24c4ee7f573982aabdc8d5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/commits/8134e84ed827b5c5884b61ad0653bd57f119ed2b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/purefoy/commit/8134e84ed827b5c5884b61ad0653bd57f119ed2b","node_id":"C_kwDOQ6l9HdoAKDgxMzRlODRlZDgyN2I1YzU4ODRiNjFhZDA2NTNiZDU3ZjExOWVkMmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/purefoy/commit/a838a1c009744344c865f348d6fbbcc4c7a5a851","sha":"a838a1c009744344c865f348d6fbbcc4c7a5a851","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/a838a1c009744344c865f348d6fbbcc4c7a5a851"}],"sha":"8134e84ed827b5c5884b61ad0653bd57f119ed2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/8134e84ed827b5c5884b61ad0653bd57f119ed2b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/a838a1c009744344c865f348d6fbbcc4c7a5a851/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-23T02:45:33Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-23T02:45:33Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"feat(api): goal data + review progress endpoints for transcript editing\n\nFive new Express routes under /api/episodes/:slug/transcript/:\n\n  GET  /transcript/goal       — stream goal JSONL (NDJSON, same as /transcript)\n  GET  /transcript/goal/meta  — read goal_manifest.json (correction stats + timestamps)\n  POST /transcript/goal       — save edited segments, diff vs original, write manifest\n  GET  /transcript/review     — read review_progress.json (returns empty if none)\n  POST /transcript/review     — union reviewed segment IDs, append session, save\n\nPOST /transcript/goal diffs the incoming segments against the original to\ncount speaker reassignments vs text edits. Goal data is stored under\ndownloads/<slug>/transcript/goal/ and never overwrites the original run.\n\nepisode-cache: buildEpisodeItem now checks for goal JSONL and review\nprogress on each episode at warm time, populating hasGoal and reviewCoverage\non every EpisodeListItem.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"eba3978996d4dc3dab74c83dd0b237ce409dea99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/trees/eba3978996d4dc3dab74c83dd0b237ce409dea99"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/commits/a838a1c009744344c865f348d6fbbcc4c7a5a851","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/purefoy/commit/a838a1c009744344c865f348d6fbbcc4c7a5a851","node_id":"C_kwDOQ6l9HdoAKGE4MzhhMWMwMDk3NDQzNDRjODY1ZjM0OGQ2ZmJiY2M0YzdhNWE4NTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/purefoy/commit/782563324706c3f9056bbf0e193a2ab93239aad3","sha":"782563324706c3f9056bbf0e193a2ab93239aad3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/782563324706c3f9056bbf0e193a2ab93239aad3"}],"sha":"a838a1c009744344c865f348d6fbbcc4c7a5a851","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/a838a1c009744344c865f348d6fbbcc4c7a5a851"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/782563324706c3f9056bbf0e193a2ab93239aad3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-23T02:45:22Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-23T02:45:22Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"feat(shared): add GoalManifest + ReviewProgress types; hasGoal/reviewCoverage on EpisodeListItem\n\nGoalManifest: persisted alongside goal data — sourceRun, createdAt,\ncorrectionSummary (speakerReassignments, textEdits, totalSegmentsModified).\n\nReviewProgress: tracks per-segment human review during editing sessions —\nreviewedSegments[], reviewCoverage (0-1), session history (last 20).\n\nEpisodeListItem: adds hasGoal: boolean and reviewCoverage: number so the\nepisode list view can show goal badges and review progress indicators.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0e9edb75c83b1d66050e5976f66f86f3354285da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/trees/0e9edb75c83b1d66050e5976f66f86f3354285da"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/commits/782563324706c3f9056bbf0e193a2ab93239aad3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/purefoy/commit/782563324706c3f9056bbf0e193a2ab93239aad3","node_id":"C_kwDOQ6l9HdoAKDc4MjU2MzMyNDcwNmMzZjkwNTZiYmYwZTE5M2EyYWI5MzIzOWFhZDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/purefoy/commit/dbab418ee65e36a1baf7b42da97352c38f967290","sha":"dbab418ee65e36a1baf7b42da97352c38f967290","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/dbab418ee65e36a1baf7b42da97352c38f967290"}],"sha":"782563324706c3f9056bbf0e193a2ab93239aad3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/782563324706c3f9056bbf0e193a2ab93239aad3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/dbab418ee65e36a1baf7b42da97352c38f967290/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-23T02:11:32Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-23T02:11:32Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"feat: standalone Flask UI — dark-theme knowledge browser (port 5050)\n\nSingle-file Flask app with Jinja2 templates and vanilla CSS/JS. No\ndependency on the Frame OS module federation architecture — runs\nindependently with just `pip install flask && python flask_app.py`.\n\nRoutes:\n  GET  /                              — SPA shell (Jinja2 index.html)\n  GET  /api/episodes                  — episode list with transcript/chapter summary\n  GET  /api/episodes/<slug>           — episode detail + stats\n  GET  /api/episodes/<slug>/chapters  — chapter list from canonical run\n  GET  /api/episodes/<slug>/transcript — segments (streaming JSONL or full JSON)\n  GET/POST /api/episodes/<slug>/transcript/goal      — curated \"goal data\" transcript\n  GET/POST /api/episodes/<slug>/transcript/goal/meta — correction manifest\n  GET/POST /api/episodes/<slug>/transcript/review    — per-segment human review progress\n  GET  /api/forum/topics              — forum topic list\n  GET  /api/forum/topics/<slug>       — topic with full post tree\n\nUI features:\n  - Netflix-style dark theme, horizontal season carousels, no vertical scroll\n  - Episode detail panel: chapters list, transcript viewer with speaker labels\n  - Forum section: topic browser with post tree\n  - Edit mode: reassign speaker labels, save corrections as goal data\n  - Review tracking: mark segments as human-reviewed, persists across sessions\n\nData sources: reads directly from downloads/ and library/forums/ flat files.\nNo database required (forum SQLite index not used here).\n\nAlso adds .venv-flask/ to .gitignore for the Flask-specific virtualenv.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"594dd783416afcacaaa2e7255b8d76ca34427fca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/trees/594dd783416afcacaaa2e7255b8d76ca34427fca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/commits/dbab418ee65e36a1baf7b42da97352c38f967290","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/purefoy/commit/dbab418ee65e36a1baf7b42da97352c38f967290","node_id":"C_kwDOQ6l9HdoAKGRiYWI0MThlZTY1ZTM2YTFiYWY3YjQyZGE5NzM1MmMzOGY5NjcyOTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/purefoy/commit/0839b0b1a10ebce8478575ed5abb40426fbd25dc","sha":"0839b0b1a10ebce8478575ed5abb40426fbd25dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/0839b0b1a10ebce8478575ed5abb40426fbd25dc"}],"sha":"dbab418ee65e36a1baf7b42da97352c38f967290","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/dbab418ee65e36a1baf7b42da97352c38f967290"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/0839b0b1a10ebce8478575ed5abb40426fbd25dc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-23T02:10:18Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-23T02:10:18Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"docs: update data-store-and-tooling — 348/348 transcribed, corpus stats\n\nAll 348 episodes are now transcribed (S02E185 Malgosia Turzanska added\n2026-03-18). Speaker embedding gaps reduced from ~65 to ~11 after\ndiscovering the embed-only re-run fixed most episodes; re-embed batch\ncompleted 2026-03-18.\n\n- Episode count: 347 → 348, all complete\n- Corpus stats updated: ~837 hrs, ~830k segments, ~8.76M words, ~18.8k chapters\n- Known issues: remove \"57 in progress\", update embedding gap ~65 → ~11\n- §2i: note re-embed batch completed 2026-03-18\n- §5: remove resolved \"57 not transcribed\" row\n- §6: note all 348 transcribed, B3 pass can begin\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8ac0529825bb539f608c99ff2a894355623b678d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/trees/8ac0529825bb539f608c99ff2a894355623b678d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/commits/0839b0b1a10ebce8478575ed5abb40426fbd25dc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"