{"date":"2026-03-23T02:10:08Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"fix(aws_runner): discover episodes with missing speaker embeddings\n\n--embed-speakers passed to discover_episodes() was silently ignored —\nthe parameter didn''t exist, so episodes with successful diarization but\nempty speaker_embeddings/ were never re-queued.\n\nChanges:\n- Add _latest_dz_run_has_embeddings() helper: checks the most recent __dz\n  run for non-empty speaker_embeddings/*.npy files\n- Add embed_speakers param to discover_episodes(): re-queues episodes\n  where diarization succeeded (speakers_detected > 0) but .npy files are\n  missing — works both when --diarize is co-present and standalone\n- Thread embed_speakers through the full-mode discover call in main()\n- Fix log message: \"undiarized re-runs\" → \"force re-runs\" (covers both\n  undiarized and missing-embedding cases)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1d0be698c7755266568e13fd33b39046cdf27bb2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/trees/1d0be698c7755266568e13fd33b39046cdf27bb2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/commits/06b89d49a4198a99248f1c1ef6cd5523987b3c00","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/purefoy/commit/06b89d49a4198a99248f1c1ef6cd5523987b3c00","node_id":"C_kwDOQ6l9HdoAKDA2Yjg5ZDQ5YTQxOThhOTkyNDhmMWMxZWY2Y2Q1NTIzOTg3YjNjMDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/purefoy/commit/242f147bbb0cc8daa7d13906b9d718d10722f605","sha":"242f147bbb0cc8daa7d13906b9d718d10722f605","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/242f147bbb0cc8daa7d13906b9d718d10722f605"}],"sha":"06b89d49a4198a99248f1c1ef6cd5523987b3c00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/06b89d49a4198a99248f1c1ef6cd5523987b3c00"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/242f147bbb0cc8daa7d13906b9d718d10722f605/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-23T02:09:59Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-23T02:09:59Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"fix(aws_runner): harden ffmpeg install on fresh DLAMI instances\n\napt-get install fails on fresh EC2 instances without apt-get update first\n(\"Unable to locate package ffmpeg\"). Also, the old pipe to tail -3 masked\nthe exit code (tail always exits 0).\n\nChanges:\n- Run apt-get update -qq before install, with 300s DPkg lock timeout to\n  survive unattended-upgrades lock contention\n- Verify ffmpeg is present after install with `which ffmpeg` (raises if not)\n- Capture actual binary directory (may be conda bin on DLAMI, not /usr/bin)\n- Store in RemoteWorker.ffmpeg_dir and prepend to nohup PATH so the\n  detached transcription process finds ffmpeg regardless of conda layout\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e91df4826f9af99ddad822d3d5893251a4e9972f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/trees/e91df4826f9af99ddad822d3d5893251a4e9972f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/commits/242f147bbb0cc8daa7d13906b9d718d10722f605","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/purefoy/commit/242f147bbb0cc8daa7d13906b9d718d10722f605","node_id":"C_kwDOQ6l9HdoAKDI0MmYxNDdiYmIwY2M4ZGFhN2QxMzkwNmI5ZDcxOGQxMDcyMmY2MDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/purefoy/commit/fce948008a4e9dec69e7d4ece217734a2e8c861f","sha":"fce948008a4e9dec69e7d4ece217734a2e8c861f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/fce948008a4e9dec69e7d4ece217734a2e8c861f"}],"sha":"242f147bbb0cc8daa7d13906b9d718d10722f605","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/242f147bbb0cc8daa7d13906b9d718d10722f605"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/fce948008a4e9dec69e7d4ece217734a2e8c861f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-18T01:48:31Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-18T01:48:31Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"fix: add swap setup to instance provisioning to prevent OOM on ECAPA load\n\ng4dn.xlarge (16 GB RAM) is OOM-killed during ECAPA speaker embedding load\nbecause the process peaks at ~14.5 GB anon-RSS — whisper model + pyannote\nresults + full episode waveform all live simultaneously in RAM.\n\nAdd a 16 GB swapfile as part of the one-time instance setup() step so\nsubsequent runs have headroom without needing manual intervention. The step\nis idempotent (checks swapon --show before re-creating).\n\nDiscovered during batch-2 targeted run (2026-03-17): 3/6 episodes OOM-killed\nbefore swap was added manually; 3/6 succeeded with swap in place.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e1e3c75df5071a2f3535cd2a9b1217a75bc2f824","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/trees/e1e3c75df5071a2f3535cd2a9b1217a75bc2f824"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/commits/fce948008a4e9dec69e7d4ece217734a2e8c861f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/purefoy/commit/fce948008a4e9dec69e7d4ece217734a2e8c861f","node_id":"C_kwDOQ6l9HdoAKGZjZTk0ODAwOGE0ZTlkZWM2OWU3ZDRlY2UyMTc3MzRhMmU4Yzg2MWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/purefoy/commit/3a145b68e17f16cafe0869a389ae9027e92e8519","sha":"3a145b68e17f16cafe0869a389ae9027e92e8519","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/3a145b68e17f16cafe0869a389ae9027e92e8519"}],"sha":"fce948008a4e9dec69e7d4ece217734a2e8c861f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/fce948008a4e9dec69e7d4ece217734a2e8c861f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/3a145b68e17f16cafe0869a389ae9027e92e8519/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-18T00:51:27Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-18T00:51:27Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"fix: set explicit PATH in detached nohup shell on remote EC2\n\nnohup sh -c runs a non-interactive, non-login shell whose PATH does not\nreliably include /usr/bin (where apt installs ffmpeg). All 6 episodes in\nthe first targeted batch failed immediately with ''ffmpeg not found on PATH''\ndespite the setup step confirming ffmpeg was installed.\n\nFix: prepend PATH=/usr/local/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin:/sbin:/bin\nto the env_prefix of every detached remote command instead of relying on the\nshell to inherit a working PATH.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ea6586f316caa0f668d0ebfec6bc7dde82a281e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/trees/ea6586f316caa0f668d0ebfec6bc7dde82a281e7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/commits/3a145b68e17f16cafe0869a389ae9027e92e8519","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/purefoy/commit/3a145b68e17f16cafe0869a389ae9027e92e8519","node_id":"C_kwDOQ6l9HdoAKDNhMTQ1YjY4ZTE3ZjE2Y2FmZTA4NjlhMzg5YWU5MDI3ZTkyZTg1