 manual token refresh (aws sso login) rather than crashing the batch.\nLogs a prominent warning every 60-300 s while waiting. All 9 EC2 call\nsites migrated from _aws() to _aws_r().\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ad0ca3ee7e7ca697119d5d1c8dd933c2f4ebff39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/trees/ad0ca3ee7e7ca697119d5d1c8dd933c2f4ebff39"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/commits/73455804a636f75ffb54e3922e136148d2876549","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/purefoy/commit/73455804a636f75ffb54e3922e136148d2876549","node_id":"C_kwDOQ6l9HdoAKDczNDU1ODA0YTYzNmY3NWZmYjU0ZTM5MjJlMTM2MTQ4ZDI4NzY1NDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/purefoy/commit/3624e1dd9ca62eb28cdf751f6cda5326adde62ee","sha":"3624e1dd9ca62eb28cdf751f6cda5326adde62ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/3624e1dd9ca62eb28cdf751f6cda5326adde62ee"}],"sha":"73455804a636f75ffb54e3922e136148d2876549","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/73455804a636f75ffb54e3922e136148d2876549"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/3624e1dd9ca62eb28cdf751f6cda5326adde62ee/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-17T04:09:37Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-17T04:11:00Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"fix(types): resolve all type errors from regenerated schema structure\n\nopenapi-typescript nests all schemas under components[''schemas''] rather than\nemitting top-level named exports. After regeneration:\n\n1. shared/src/index.ts: add named type aliases for all Python-derived schemas\n   (PostLeaf, TopicLeaf, PostType, ChapterResult, etc.) so consumers can\n   import by name instead of via components[''schemas''][''Foo'']\n\n2. shared/src/api-types.ts: import PostType via components alias (not as a\n   named export from schema.ts)\n\n3. api/src/types.ts: remove TranscriptJson, TranscriptMeta, TranscriptStatistics,\n   SpeakerCluster — these were in the old hand-written schema.ts but were never\n   in the generated one; add WordTimestamp which is\n\n4. api/src/services/episode-cache.ts: null-coalesce ExtractionReport optional\n   fields (chapters_generated, word_count, speakers_detected)\n\n5. api/src/services/forum-db.ts: null-coalesce TopicLeaf.post_ids (optional\n   in generated schema); use optional chain on post.timestamps\n\n6. browser-app/src/components/TranscriptViewer.tsx: optional chain on\n   SegmentCompact.topics (optional in generated schema)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a45b31802219ddd2873400acbbcaaa5d6add0ef9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/trees/a45b31802219ddd2873400acbbcaaa5d6add0ef9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/commits/3624e1dd9ca62eb28cdf751f6cda5326adde62ee","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/purefoy/commit/3624e1dd9ca62eb28cdf751f6cda5326adde62ee","node_id":"C_kwDOQ6l9HdoAKDM2MjRlMWRkOWNhNjJlYjI4Y2RmNzUxZjZjZGE1MzI2YWRkZTYyZWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/purefoy/commit/c3fa53dbf9445f8fc81d946ee2a9ad71cd95a986","sha":"c3fa53dbf9445f8fc81d946ee2a9ad71cd95a986","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/c3fa53dbf9445f8fc81d946ee2a9ad71cd95a986"}],"sha":"3624e1dd9ca62eb28cdf751f6cda5326adde62ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/3624e1dd9ca62eb28cdf751f6cda5326adde62ee"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/c3fa53dbf9445f8fc81d946ee2a9ad71cd95a986/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-17T04:04:47Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-17T04:11:00Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"fix(ci): resolve three CI failures on PR #9\n\n1. openapi-typescript $ref resolution (Codegen schema drift check)\n   - generate_schema.py: pass ref_template=''#/components/schemas/{model}''\n     to model_json_schema() so Pydantic emits $refs pointing at the OpenAPI\n     components/schemas path instead of the default ''#/$defs/{model}''\n   - Also hoist any $defs that Pydantic still emits (self-referential models)\n     up to the top-level schemas dict\n   - Regenerate openapi.json and schema.ts with the fixed generator\n   - Commit both files (they were missing from the branch entirely)\n\n2. pnpm test --run (TypeScript type-check & tests)\n   - ci.yml: pnpm --filter @purefoy/api test --run\n     → pnpm --filter @purefoy/api test -- --run\n   - The double-dash is required to pass --run to vitest, not to pnpm\n\n3. engines.node >=24.11.1 (produces WARN on Node 20 CI runners)\n   - Relax to >=20.0.0 — better-sqlite3@11 builds on Node 20 LTS\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f05928aed089568d5edecfa851f3487c5fa52ef5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/trees/f05928aed089568d5edecfa851f3487c5fa52ef5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/commits/c3fa53dbf9445f8fc81d946ee2a9ad71cd95a986","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.