ceived_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/faf7cad040a6407739f72508700157a91a1418f8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-17T03:13:30Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-17T04:11:00Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"feat(codegen): pnpm codegen pipeline — Pydantic → openapi.json → schema.ts\n\nscripts/generate_schema.py: walks deakins_forums Pydantic models + transcript dataclasses,\n  emits openapi.json with all schema definitions\n\nscripts/codegen.mjs: Node shim that runs generate_schema.py then calls openapi-typescript\n  to emit packages/shared/src/generated/schema.ts\n\nRun with `pnpm codegen` after any Python model changes. Both output files are committed\nso downstream consumers don''t need Python installed (ADR-007).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d398a3386e4571ec904013128d2c78674c03a591","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/trees/d398a3386e4571ec904013128d2c78674c03a591"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/commits/faf7cad040a6407739f72508700157a91a1418f8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{