"url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/6a772d6872528c381a6ab115013a91809ce66871/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-17T03:13:21Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-17T04:11:00Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"feat(browser-app): Team Deakins Engine — React/Vite MF remote (port 3020)\n\nFrame OS Module Federation remote serving ./Dashboard and ./Settings.\nFollows the three-sibling layout pattern (ThreadSidebar + dashboard-wrapper + CondensedChat)\nused across all Frame sub-apps (cv-builder, BlogEngine, TripPlanner).\n\nKey components:\n- DashboardContent: flex height chain for shell-mode scroll containment\n  (.cds--tab-panels flex:1 min-height:0, .cds--tab-content height:100% overflow-y:auto)\n- EpisodeBrowser: paginated episode list (Carbon DataTable), opens EpisodeDetail\n- EpisodeDetail: chapter list → transcript seek; ChapterResult uses Python snake_case field names\n- ForumBrowser: topic list + inline post detail with breadcrumb nav\n- ForumSearch: FTS5 results with dangerouslySetInnerHTML for <mark> snippet highlighting\n- TranscriptViewer: segment list with speaker labels and type badges\n- CondensedChat: SSE streaming to frame-agent POST /api/chat/stream; 3 display states\n- ThreadSidebar: localStorage thread persistence, slide-in panel, inert attr for a11y\n\nStore slices: episodesSlice, forumSlice, chatSlice, uiSlice\nConfig: cssInjectedByJs before federation plugin (required for Carbon CSS injection in MF)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"56335b1402af2d0364931ec4d69243a37e4c413c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/trees/56335b1402af2d0364931ec4d69243a37e4c413c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/commits/6a772d6872528c381a6ab115013a91809ce66871","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/purefoy/commit/6a772d6872528c381a6ab115013a91809ce66871","node_id":"C_kwDOQ6l9HdoAKDZhNzcyZDY4NzI1MjhjMzgxYTZhYjExNTAxM2E5MTgwOWNlNjY4NzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/purefoy/commit/238dc239bdf059bfff4ef95a8d8c45a9a4e1e99e","sha":"238dc239bdf059bfff4ef95a8d8c45a9a4e1e99e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/238dc239bdf059bfff4ef95a8d8c45a9a4e1e99e"}],"sha":"6a772d6872528c381a6ab115013a91809ce66871","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/6a772d6872528c381a6ab115013a91809ce66871"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/238dc239bdf059bfff4ef95a8d8c45a9a4e1e99e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-17T03:12:16Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-17T04:11:00Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"feat(api): purefoy-api — Express read-only API over flat JSON + SQLite (port 3021)\n\nRoutes:\n  GET /health, /api/tools\n  GET /api/episodes[/:slug][/chapters][/transcript]\n  GET /api/forum/topics[/:slug], /api/forum/search\n\nKey implementation details:\n- episode-cache.ts: startup warm cache + fs.watch for incremental refresh; EMFILE handled\n  via watcher.on(''error'') — synchronous try/catch alone is insufficient\n- forum-db.ts: better-sqlite3@11 FTS5 search; error detection via .code (not .message)\n  because v11 SqliteError uses SQLITE_CANTOPEN code, not message-based strings\n- forum route search: wrapped in try/catch — unhandled async rejection was crashing Express\n- All paths from env: DOWNLOADS_DIR, LIBRARY_DIR (no hardcoded filesystem assumptions)\n- Types: pure re-exports from @purefoy/shared; no duplicate definitions in this package\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4e8bae9f3d9ff47bf4a23556b81a9898562001e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/trees/4e8bae9f3d9ff47bf4a23556b81a9898562001e8"},"url