"user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/3a43e93beba9585f4b9210bdd0f08462ebeb65f4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-06T02:39:13Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-06T02:40:48Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"fix(tests): mock numpy/torch to unblock speaker embedding tests on Python 3.13\n\nThe 3 failing tests in TestExportSpeakerEmbeddingsErrorHandling were hitting\nthe outer `except ImportError` guard in _export_speaker_embeddings() before\nreaching any speechbrain code, because numpy and torch are not installed in\nthe Python 3.13 test environment.\n\nFix: extract _mock_heavy_deps() helper that injects fake numpy, torch, and\nspeechbrain into sys.modules so the function body can be exercised. Also\napplied to test_does_not_overwrite_existing_custom_py_stub, which was\npreviously passing by accident (early-return meant custom.py was never\nreached, so \"not overwritten\" was trivially true).\n\nAll 75 tests now pass on Python 3.13 without heavy ML deps installed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c476ab08f16a737738297f16c04124877a0c7e4b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/trees/c476ab08f16a737738297f16c04124877a0c7e4b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/commits/3a43e93beba9585f4b9210bdd0f08462ebeb65f4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/purefoy/commit/3a43e93beba9585f4b9210bdd0f08462ebeb65f4","node_id":"C_kwDOQ6l9HdoAKDNhNDNlOTNiZWJhOTU4NWY0YjkyMTBiZGQwZjA4NDYyZWJlYjY1ZjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/purefoy/commit/d158eb74d424988f94b9c90e5271192d49695537","sha":"d158eb74d424988f94b9c90e5271192d49695537","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/d158eb74d424988f94b9c90e5271192d49695537"}],"sha":"3a43e93beba9585f4b9210bdd0f08462ebeb65f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/3a43e93beba9585f4b9210bdd0f08462ebeb65f4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/d158eb74d424988f94b9c90e5271192d49695537/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-06T02:30:59Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-06T02:40:48Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"test: unit coverage for speaker embedding fixes and detached execution\n\nAdds 29 new tests across two files to cover all code changes made\nin this session that were previously untested.\n\ntests/test_transcribe_segments.py:\n  TestLoadDiarizationPatches (3 tests)\n    - hf_hub_download `use_auth_token` → `token` rename patch\n    - pass-through for already-correct `token` kwarg\n    - positional args preserved through patch\n\n  TestExportSpeakerEmbeddingsErrorHandling (5 tests)\n    - stub custom.py created when missing (avoids speechbrain 404)\n    - existing stub not overwritten\n    - clusters.json written with error dict on ECAPA load failure\n    - error dict includes exception type and message\n    - early return when speechbrain not installed\n\ntests/test_aws_runner.py:\n  TestLaunchDetached (5 tests)\n    - PID returned on success\n    - RuntimeError on non-zero SSH exit\n    - RuntimeError when stdout is not a digit\n    - mkdir called before nohup launch\n    - nohup + echo $! wrapping verified\n\n  TestPollUntilDone (8 tests)\n    - returns on first poll if done marker present\n    - keeps polling until marker appears\n    - RuntimeError when process dies without marker\n    - log tail embedded in RuntimeError message\n    - TimeoutError when deadline exceeded\n    - TimeoutError includes ssh recovery command\n    - exponential backoff after SSH timeout (30s → 60s)\n    - backoff capped at 600s\n\n  TestProcessEpisodeReconnect (8 tests)\n    - no re-launch when done marker already on remote\n    - rsync still runs on reconnect\n    - remote dir not deleted on TimeoutError\n    - remote dir not deleted on RuntimeError\n    - done marker path includes run_id when set\n    - done marker falls back to legacy path without run_id\n    - _finish_local writes run_manifest.json with run_id\n    - _finish_local is no-op without run_id\n\nAll 49 test_aws_runner tests pass; 46 test_transcribe_segments tests pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"16b9a9cf3a7d2441573a0de43dfba2275dcfe783","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/trees/16b9a9cf3a7d2441573a0de43dfba2275dcfe783"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/commits/d158eb74d424988f94b9c90e5271192d49695537","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/purefoy/commit/d158eb74d424988f94b9c90e5271192d49695537","node_id":"C_kwDOQ6l9HdoAKGQxNThlYjc0ZDQyNDk4OGY5NGI5YzkwZTUyNzExOTJkNDk2OTU1Mzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/purefoy/commit/8c6c7f3843fe3560fb2607295f2ad2e918c5a97f","sha":"8c6c7f3843fe3560fb2607295f2ad2e918c5a97f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/8c6c7f3843fe3560fb2607295f2ad2e918c5a97f"}],"sha":"d158eb74d424988f94b9c90e5271192d49695537","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/d158eb74d424988f94b9c90e5271192d49695537"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/8c6c7f3843fe3560fb2607295f2ad2e918c5a97f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-05T17:07:59Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-06T02:40:48Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"feat: detached remote execution — survives SSH disconnect\n\nReplace blocking SSH transcription call with nohup detach + polling loop.\n\nKey changes in RemoteWorker:\n\n- _launch_detached(): launches job via `nohup sh -c ... & echo $!`,\n  returns remote PID. Job continues running if SSH connection drops.\n\n- _poll_until_done(): polls `test -f extraction_report.json` every 60s.\n  Handles transient SSH failures with exponential back-off (30s → 10 min\n  cap). Reads remote log tail on job failure for local diagnosis.\n\n- process_episode(): step 0 checks for existing done marker on remote\n  (reconnect scenario) — skips to rsync if found, no re-transcription.\n  Cleanup (rm -rf) now runs only after successful rsync; on job failure,\n  remote dir is intentionally preserved for manual recovery.\n\n- _finish_local(): extracted from process_episode for reuse.\n\nRecovery workflow on disconnect:\n  1. Remote job continues via nohup\n  2. Re-run aws_runner.py --hosts <same-ip> --skip-setup --mode full\n  3. discover_episodes() skips completed episodes (local check)\n  4. process_episode() skips remote-done episodes (step 0 remote check)\n  5. Remaining/partial episodes are rsynced and completed\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c7723d617ecb43206bd38c166992900dc1e2ebb4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/trees/c7723d617ecb43206bd38c166992900dc1e2ebb4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/commits/8c6c7f3843fe3560fb2607295f2ad2e918c5a97f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/purefoy/commit/8c6c7f3843fe3560fb2607295f2ad2e918c5a97f","node_id":"C_kwDOQ6l9HdoAKDhjNmM3ZjM4NDNmZTM1NjBmYjI2MDcyOTVmMmFkMmU5MThjNWE5N2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/purefoy/commit/10ed1c47c7fc45a8231edcddaaeae0e1eae9fde8","sha":"10ed1c47c7fc45a8231edcddaaeae0e1eae9fde8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/10ed1c47c7fc45a8231edcddaaeae0e1eae9fde8"}],"sha":"8c6c7f3843fe3560fb2607295f2ad2e918c5a97f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/8c6c7f3843fe3560fb2607295f2ad2e918c5a97f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/10ed1c47c7fc45a8231edcddaaeae0e1eae9fde8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-05T16:55:05Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-06T02:40:48Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"fix: speaker embedding export — stub custom.py + hf_hub_download patch\n\nThree bugs in _export_speaker_embeddings / _load_diarization:\n\n1. speechbrain 1.0.3 from_hparams() tries to download custom.py from HF;\n   spkrec-ecapa-voxceleb has no custom.py → 404 → silent failure.\n   Fix: create stub custom.py in savedir before from_hparams().\n\n2. speechbrain 1.0.3 uses hf_hub_download(use_auth_token=) which was\n   renamed to token= in huggingface_hub ≥0.21.\n   Fix: monkey-patch hf_hub_download in _load_diarization (same place\n   as the torchaudio patch applied for pyannote).\n\n3. extraction_report.json was missing embed_speakers field — it was not\n   stored in TranscriptionResult nor written to the report dict.\n   Fix: write clusters.json error record on ECAPA load failure so\n   failures are diagnosable without EC2 log access.\n\nImpact: 65 episodes in the overnight batch have empty speaker_embeddings/\n(ECAPA silently failed). Remaining ~279 episodes will capture embeddings\ncorrectly with the patched script already pushed to EC2.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f426435394c602ca7352ba4aa1ffbab608f6863b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/trees/f426435394c602ca7352ba4aa1ffbab608f6863b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/commits/10ed1c47c7fc45a8231edcddaaeae0e1eae9fde8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/purefoy/commit/10ed1c47c7fc45a8231edcddaaeae0e1eae9fde8","node_id":"C_kwDOQ6l9HdoAKDEwZWQxYzQ3YzdmYzQ1YTgyMzFlZGNkZGFhZWFlMGUxZWFlOWZkZTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/purefoy/commit/4e6b684bf4b4f7d99ac6f1e8a3e0b195b9fba592","sha":"4e6b684bf4b4f7d99ac6f1e8a3e0b195b9fba592","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/4e6b684bf4b4f7d99ac6f1e8a3e0b195b9fba592"}],"sha":"10ed1c47c7fc45a8231edcddaaeae0e1eae9fde8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/10ed1c47c7fc45a8231edcddaaeae0e1eae9fde8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/4e6b684bf4b4f7d99ac6f1e8a3e0b195b9fba592/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-05T03:44:35Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-05T03:55:07Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"fix: terminate_instances scoped to current run — not all project instances\n\nterminate_instances_by_tag() killed every project-tagged EC2 instance,\nincluding concurrent batch runs on separate instances. Discovered when\nthe smoke-test run terminated the still-running 50-episode batch.\n\nChanges:\n  - Renamed terminate_instances_by_tag() → terminate_instances(ids)\n  - provision_spot_instances() now returns (ips, instance_ids)\n  - provisioned_ids threaded through main() so all terminate call sites\n    only affect the instances launched in this run\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"43c6ff1d7a7687d95987735160b2732ffac33f6e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/trees/43c6ff1d7a7687d95987735160b2732ffac33f6e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/commits/4e6b684bf4b4f7d99ac6f1e8a3e0b195b9fba592","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/purefoy/commit/4e6b684bf4b4f7d99ac6f1e8a3e0b195b9fba592","node_id":"C_kwDOQ6l9HdoAKDRlNmI2ODRiZjRiNGY3ZDk5YWM2ZjFlOGEzZTBiMTk1YjlmYmE1OTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/purefoy/commit/26784c679891281bc494109b2d2fb74d2e789877","sha":"26784c679891281bc494109b2d2fb74d2e789877","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/26784c679891281bc494109b2d2fb74d2e789877"}],"sha":"4e6b684bf4b4f7d99ac6f1e8a3e0b195b9fba592","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/4e6b684bf4b4f7d99ac6f1e8a3e0b195b9fba592"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/26784c679891281bc494109b2d2fb74d2e789877/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-05T03:12:15Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-05T03:55:07Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"fix: address all code review findings from PR #5\n\n🔴 Required (security + correctness):\n  - aws_runner: remove HF_TOKEN write to ~/.profile — token already\n    passed as env-var prefix on remote commands; disk write leaks on\n    snapshots and accumulates duplicate lines on repeated setup() calls\n  - transcribe_episodes: tag_segment_types call guards against None\n    total_audio_duration with `or 0.0` (float | None — mypy catch)\n  - aws_runner: remove hardcoded S02E169 edgar-wright slug from main()\n  - aws_runner: update_sg_ssh_rule() now only revokes stale CIDRs, not\n    all SSH rules — preserves any other team member IP rules on the SG\n\n🟡 Recommended:\n  - aws_runner: make_run_id comment corrected (\"larg\" not \"lv3\")\n  - aws_runner: pyannote install failure now raises RuntimeError instead\n    of logging a warning — prevents silent speakers_detected=0 runs\n  - aws_runner: speakers_detected sentinel changed from -1 magic value\n    to None-safe == 0 check\n  - transcribe_episodes: torchaudio monkey-patch comment adds versions\n    and TODO to remove once pyannote upstream fixes the call\n  - transcribe_episodes: dead unreachable None check removed from\n    _apply_diarization (try/finally guarantees _audio_input is set or\n    exception propagates before the check)\n\n🔵 Nits:\n  - transcribe_episodes: segment_type typed as Literal[\"intro\",\"outro\",\"content\"]\n  - transcribe_episodes: _export_speaker_embeddings logs at DEBUG when\n    30-segment cap is hit so post-run analysis can spot under-sampling\n  - tests: sleep(1.01) comment explains second-resolution timestamp constraint\n  - tests: _seg() helper renamed id param to seg_id (shadows built-in)\n\nAll 46 tests pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e007177450245be471d37195902c82d1252ab4ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/trees/e