"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/773e859841510f29e09226e2971017a76bbddb25/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-05T02:17:42Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-05T03:55:07Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"test: transcription pipeline — user-pattern coverage for diarization, discovery, segments\n\n46 tests covering the failure modes discovered on 2026-03-04:\n\ntest_aws_runner.py:\n- TestDiscoverEpisodes: 10 tests — fresh episodes, diarized runs skipped, undiarized\n  re-queued when --diarize set, per-episode force flags, --limit, alphabetical order\n- TestMakeRunId: 9 tests — format pattern, dz/nd suffix, model slug, uniqueness\n- TestUpdateRunManifest: 4 tests — create, append, canonical pointer, corrupt file survival\n- TestPipInstallCommandDesign: 2 regression tests — speechbrain==1.0.3 pinned,\n  set -o pipefail present (source-code checks that catch reintroduction of the bugs)\n- TestUpdateSgSshRule: 3 tests — noop on IP match, update on IP change, graceful\n  handling when IP lookup fails\n\ntest_transcribe_segments.py:\n- TestTagSegmentTypes: 13 tests — intro/outro windows, boundary values (@parametrize),\n  in-place mutation contract, empty list, duration=0 safety\n- TestSegmentResult: 3 tests — required fields, speaker defaults to None, chapter_id default\n\nTests are named as behaviour sentences, not internal identifiers.\nAssertion messages explain *why* the rule exists for human/LLM readers.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9241c7c4ab3ad0b2b945571c9cc655b699d69c3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/trees/9241c7c4ab3ad0b2b945571c9cc655b699d69c3e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/commits/773e859841510f29e09226e2971017a76bbddb25","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/purefoy/commit/773e859841510f29e09226e2971017a76bbddb25","node_id":"C_kwDOQ6l9HdoAKDc3M2U4NTk4NDE1MTBmMjllMDkyMjZlMjk3MTAxN2E3NmJiZGRiMjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/purefoy/commit/31236b7aefbb368bfedd47ac8911e3e50b5a7042","sha":"31236b7aefbb368bfedd47ac8911e3e50b5a7042","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/31236b7aefbb368bfedd47ac8911e3e50b5a7042"}],"sha":"773e859841510f29e09226e2971017a76bbddb25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/773e859841510f29e09226e2971017a76bbddb25"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/31236b7aefbb368bfedd47ac8911e3e50b5a7042/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-05T02:17:24Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-05T03:55:07Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"chore: requirements-transcription — pin pyannote==4.0.4 and speechbrain==1.0.3\n\nPin exact versions that were validated on DLAMI (ami-0016081b488c7376d, torch 2.10.0+cu128).\nspeechbrain==1.0.3 is the latest release; 1.0.4 does not exist and caused silent\ninstall failure on 2026-03-04 (pip exit code was swallowed by | tail -20 pipe).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ebcea43ad11eef656a872021598f1f79a2bab656","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/trees/ebcea43ad11eef656a872021598f1f79a2bab656"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/commits/31236b7aefbb368bfedd47ac8911e3e50b5a7042","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/purefoy/commit/31236b7aefbb368bfedd47ac8911e3e50b5a7042","node_id":"C_kwDOQ6l9HdoAKDMxMjM2YjdhZWZiYjM2OGJmZWRkNDdhYzg5MTFlM2U1MGI1YTcwNDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/purefoy/commit/230389dcec2fb5ee1216034b31dcb8df39c67709","sha":"230389dcec2fb5ee1216034b31dcb8df39c67709","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/230389dcec2fb5ee1216034b31dcb8df39c67709"}],"sha":"31236b7aefbb368bfedd47ac8911e3e50b5a7042","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/31236b7aefbb368bfedd47ac8911e3e50b5a7042"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/230389dcec2fb5ee1216034b31dcb8df39c67709/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-05T02:17:16Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-05T03:55:07Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"fix: aws_runner — diarization reliability, SG auto-update, undiarized re-queue, --limit\n\nReliability fixes discovered during 2026-03-04 test batch:\n- speechbrain==1.0.4 does not exist on PyPI; correct pin is ==1.0.3\n- pip install with `| tail -20` swallows pip exit code (tail exits 0 even on pip failure);\n  fixed with `set -o pipefail;` prefix — now fails loudly\n- SSH SG rule auto-updated before wait_for_ssh(); prevents 360s timeout when local IP changes\n- Setup failure now calls terminate_instances_by_tag() — no more orphaned billable instances\n- SSH wait timeout 180s → 360s (DLAMI takes 3-5 min to boot)\n- pip install timeout 600s → 3600s (belt-and-suspenders; actual install now takes ~90s)\n\nNew features:\n- discover_episodes() with diarize=True re-queues episodes where speakers_detected=0\n  (per-episode force=True so remote script overwrites the undiarized transcript)\n- --limit N caps episode queue at N for incremental batches (e.g. --limit 50)\n- --diarize / --hf-token / --embed-speakers propagated to remote transcribe command\n- HF_TOKEN passed as env-var prefix on remote command (not --hf-token flag) to avoid\n  token appearing in /proc/{pid}/cmdline on the remote instance\n- run_id generated at batch start, shared across all episodes in the batch\n- update_run_manifest() called locally after each successful rsync\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"eea14f61d1abf020ac4bdae3d49de6385e49dc98","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/trees/eea14f61d1abf020ac4bdae3d49de6385e49dc98"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/commits/230389dcec2fb5ee1216034b31dcb8df39c67709","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/purefoy/commit/230389dcec2fb5ee1216034b31dcb8df39c67709","node_id":"C_kwDOQ6l9HdoAKDIzMDM4OWRjZWMyZmI1ZWUxMjE2MDM0YjMxZGNiOGRmMzljNjc3MDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/purefoy/commit/094908388878ef841cdfce502966ec89182a23c3","sha":"094908388878ef841cdfce502966ec89182a23c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/094908388878ef841cdfce502966ec89182a23c3"}],"sha":"230389dcec2fb5ee1216034b31dcb8df39c67709","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/230389dcec2fb5ee1216034b31dcb8df39c67709"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/commits/094908388878ef841cdfce502966ec89182a23c3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-05T02:17:00Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-05T03:55:07Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"feat: transcribe_episodes v2.0.0 — multi-run layout, diarization, intro/outro tagging\n\n- Multi-run output: transcript/runs/{run_id}/ with run_manifest.json canonical pointer\n- SegmentResult gains segment_type (intro/outro/content) and chapter_id fields\n- tag_segment_types(): time-window tagger (first 90s = intro, last 120s = outro)\n- Chapter generation filters intro/outro segments; backfills chapter_id per segment\n- VAD tuning: min_silence_duration_ms 500 → 800 (better for long-form podcast speech)\n- --diarize: pyannote.audio 4.x inline diarization; CUDA if available\n- --embed-speakers: ECAPA-TDNN per-cluster embeddings → speaker_embeddings/*.npy\n- --run-id: version output directory; legacy flat layout still works without it\n- PIPELINE_VERSION bumped to \"2.0.0\"\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cd099b80a75e2b089f2d63c6b689cad0185ace44","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/trees/cd099b80a75e2b089f2d63c6b689cad0185ace44"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/commits/094908388878ef841cdfce502966ec89182a23c3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/purefoy/commit/094908388878ef841cdfce502966ec89182a23c3","node_id":"C_kwDOQ6l9HdoAKDA5NDkwODM4ODg3OGVmODQxY2RmY2U1MDI5NjZlYzg5MTgyYTIzYzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/purefoy/commit/0c4f0190c6659f32662ecfce912a33f45f1bad2b","sha":"0c4f0190c6659f32662ecfce912a33f45f1bad2b","url":"https://api.