 clustering); add\n  speaker_profiles/ storage schema; affirm zero-label constraint explicitly\n- transcription-optimization.md §1.4 + §3: mark Option B (manual clip) as rejected;\n  adopt cross-episode clustering as the sole approach; update implementation sketch\n  to two-phase design; replace manual review workflow with zero-label validation\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4caceb8d261a91c2db2d31c248108b71540f5ee4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/trees/4caceb8d261a91c2db2d31c248108b71540f5ee4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/purefoy/git/commits/0c4f0190c6659f32662ecfce912a33f45f1bad2b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/purefoy/commit/0c4f0190c6659f32662ecfce912a33f45f1bad2b","node_id":"C_kwDOQ6l9HdoAKDBjNGYwMTkwYzY2NTlmMzI2NjJlY2ZjZTkxMmEzM2Y0NWYxYmFkMmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/purefoy/commit/3d1c79332c2d19fb1d442d90f94f042ff114534e","sha":"3d1c79332c2d