dd1586b4dd7da8740efa3f4c68d6829c060895e1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T10:36:12Z","email":"liyue_cheng@163.com","name":"程璃月"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T10:36:12Z","email":"liyue_cheng@163.com","name":"程璃月"},"message":"docs: add 2026-06-11 change report for audit\n\nCovers all three commits of the day (interrupt system + governance, README\nrewrite + 0.2.0, executors + EchoSuppressor removal + 0.3.0): motivations,\nfix-by-fix table with severity, behavior changes, decisions made on the\nauthor''s behalf (flagged for review), known limitations, and audit entry\npoints.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d6eb20ab43454c6547019b5d3bf183fde3d90796","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Liyue-Cheng/front-cpu/git/trees/d6eb20ab43454c6547019b5d3bf183fde3d90796"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Liyue-Cheng/front-cpu/git/commits/dd1586b4dd7da8740efa3f4c68d6829c060895e1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127848794?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Liyue-Cheng","id":127848794,"login":"Liyue-Cheng","node_id":"U_kgDOB57RWg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Liyue-Cheng/front-cpu/commit/dd1586b4dd7da8740efa3f4c68d6829c060895e1","node_id":"C_kwDOQ7HOu9oAKGRkMTU4NmI0ZGQ3ZGE4NzQwZWZhM2Y0YzY4ZDY4MjljMDYwODk1ZTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Liyue-Cheng/front-cpu/commit/fa23a262c76f80a73cc0a3910ef3ecc2288a5837","sha":"fa23a262c76f80a73cc0a3910ef3ecc2288a5837","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Liyue-Cheng/front-cpu/commits/fa23a262c76f80a73cc0a3910ef3ecc2288a5837"}],"sha":"dd1586b4dd7da8740efa3f4c68d6829c060895e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Liyue-Cheng/front-cpu/commits/dd1586b4dd7da8740efa3f4c68d6829c060895e1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127848794?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Liyue-Cheng","id":127848794,"login":"Liyue-Cheng","node_id":"U_kgDOB57RWg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Liyue-Cheng/front-cpu/commits/fa23a262c76f80a73cc0a3910ef3ecc2288a5837/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T10:28:18Z","email":"liyue_cheng@163.com","name":"程璃月"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T10:28:18Z","email":"liyue_cheng@163.com","name":"程璃月"},"message":"feat: pluggable executors; remove EchoSuppressor (dedup is ISR business logic)\n\nRegistered executors (v0.3.0) — declarative instructions for any transport:\n- registerExecutor(name, fn) / PipelineConfig.executors (instance-first,\n  global-fallback, same pattern as every other dependency)\n- instructions declare `executor: ''name''` + `config` (opaque to the library —\n  hard keys, soft values applied to the execution layer)\n- precedence: executor > request > execute; `request` is conceptually the\n  built-in HTTP executor, `execute` stays as the inline escape hatch\n\nRemoved EchoSuppressor / createLoggedEchoSuppressor:\n- deduplication is ISR-side business logic by design and must use exact\n  criteria; the resourceId+TTL channel was a time-window heuristic with a\n  silent false-positive window (and notice-based registration had a real\n  registration-vs-event race)\n- READMEs now document the exact patterns instead: correlationId table for\n  server-echoed ids, state comparison (local state updated before dispatch,\n  so no registration step and no race) for identity-less sources like file\n  watchers\n- onInterruptDeduplicated(channel) widened to string (voluntary reporting\n  from ISR business logic); analyzeInterrupts().dedupByChannel is now\n  Record<string, number>\n- playground demo rewritten to state-comparison dedup (local state first,\n  then dispatch; echo compares disk content vs local state)\n\nTests: 70 green (5 new executor tests, 5 removed with EchoSuppressor).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5ed6c0e3b8981e5893180a51f0307f7c1eee5eb1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Liyue-Cheng/front-cpu/git/trees/5ed6c0e3b8981e5893180a51f0307f7c1eee5eb1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Liyue-Cheng/front-cpu/git/commits/fa23a262c76f80a73cc0a3910ef3ecc2288a5837","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127848794?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Liyue-Cheng","id":127848794,"login":"Liyue-Cheng","node_id":"U_kgDOB57RWg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Liyue-Cheng/front-cpu/commit/fa23a262c76f80a73cc0a3910ef3ecc2288a5837","node_id":"C_kwDOQ7HOu9oAKGZhMjNhMjYyYzc2ZjgwYTczY2MwYTM5MTBlZjNlY2MyMjg4YTU4Mzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Liyue-Cheng/front-cpu/commit/a32b172519753aa9d6d9d826690daf9df424ffa5","sha":"a32b172519753aa9d6d9d826690daf9df424ffa5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Liyue-Cheng/front-cpu/commits/a32b172519753aa9d6d9d826690daf9df424ffa5"}],"sha":"fa23a262c76f80a73cc0a3910ef3ecc2288a5837","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Liyue-Cheng/front-cpu/commits/fa23a262c76f80a73cc0a3910ef3ecc2288a5837"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127848794?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Liyue-Cheng","id":127848794,"login":"Liyue-Cheng","node_id":"U_kgDOB57RWg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Liyue-Cheng/front-cpu/commits/a32b172519753aa9d6d9d826690daf9df424ffa5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T09:45:50Z","email":"liyue_cheng@163.com","name":"程璃月"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T09:45:50Z","email":"liyue_cheng@163.com","name":"程璃月"},"message":"docs: rewrite README around declarative scheduling + ISA registry; release 0.2.0\n\nREADME (both languages) restructured around the actual value hierarchy:\n1. declarative concurrency (resource-aware scheduling) as the crown jewel\n2. the ISA central registry as a high-cohesion / low-coupling structural\n   device — auditable, evolvable, and the single correct answer for\n   AI-written codebases\n3. the complete causality loop (outbound instructions + inbound interrupts)\n4. zero-code observability demoted from headline to derived benefit\n\nNew sections: lifecycle guarantees (v0.2.0 hard guarantees), per-pipeline\nconfiguration, \"what it is not\" positioning table; scheduling fine print\nfolded into each strategy. Version bumped to 0.2.0 with full CHANGELOG\n(one behavior change: default strategy serial -> out-of-order, matching\nthe long-documented behavior).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c64e2d0243efcf8f887cc1161db900977c365e3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Liyue-Cheng/front-cpu/git/trees/c64e2d0243efcf8f887cc1161db900977c365e3c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Liyue-Cheng/front-cpu/git/commits/a32b172519753aa9d6d9d826690daf9df424ffa5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127848794?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Liyue-Cheng","id":127848794,"login":"Liyue-Cheng","node_id":"U_kgDOB57RWg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Liyue-Cheng/front-cpu/commit/a32b172519753aa9d6d9d826690daf9df424ffa5","node_id":"C_kwDOQ7HOu9oAKGEzMmIxNzI1MTk3NTNhYTlkNmQ5ZDgyNjY5MGRhZjlkZjQyNGZmYTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Liyue-Cheng/front-cpu/commit/5846ba3da5898b7e0ea5694bedac91f97748d066","sha":"5846ba3da5898b7e0ea5694bedac91f97748d066","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Liyue-Cheng/front-cpu/commits/5846ba3da5898b7e0ea5694bedac91f97748d066"}],"sha":"a32b172519753aa9d6d9d826690daf9df424ffa5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Liyue-Cheng/front-cpu/commits/a32b172519753aa9d6d9d826690daf9df424ffa5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127848794?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Liyue-Cheng","id":127848794,"login":"Liyue-Cheng","node_id":"U_kgDOB57RWg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Liyue-Cheng/front-cpu/commits/5846ba3da5898b7e0ea5694bedac91f97748d066/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T09:45:36Z","email":"liyue_cheng@163.com","name":"程璃月"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T09:45:36Z","email":"liyue_cheng@163.com","name":"程璃月"},"message":"feat: interrupt system, per-pipeline DI, and scheduler/lifecycle overhaul\n\nInterrupt system (the README-promised API, finally real):\n- InterruptController per pipeline: register ISRs / raise interrupts /\n  CompletionNotice delivery on every terminal state\n- EchoSuppressor: optional ISR-side echo dedup (correlationId + resourceId\n  channels with TTL); dedup is ISR business logic, not controller core\n- Interrupt logging wired through collector/logger/console (the three\n  previously unused INTERRUPT_* event types), analyzeInterrupts()\n- Playground: real file-watcher chain demo (write to disk -> chokidar ->\n  raise -> controller -> ISR -> screen)\n\nPer-pipeline dependency injection (instance-first, global-fallback):\n- PipelineConfig.isa / resourceStrategies / correlationIdGenerator /\n  httpClient / logging; all global APIs keep working as global defaults\n\nScheduler & lifecycle fixes:\n- promise resolver leak on RES/WB throw; commit failure mis-counted as success\n- latest-strategy cancellation moved out of the conflict predicate into issue()\n- single-pass O(n) tick; completion-driven scheduling (16ms tick is now\n  only a fallback heartbeat); scheduleNext pump + claimed-set guard close\n  the async-validate double-execution window\n- IF buffer leak (every instruction was retained forever)\n- flushed pending instructions settle immediately instead of hanging\n- reset() aborts in-flight work; generation guard keeps zombie completions\n  from polluting post-reset state\n- timeout now aborts the underlying execution and clears its timer\n- resourceIdentifier called exactly once per instruction and cached\n  (impure extractors can no longer leak locks)\n- localStorage guard in CPUConsole (debug entry no longer crashes in Node);\n  pipeline utilization actually implemented\n\nTests: 47 -> 70, all green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8a99a70bfcdae2d513976f1c6a7fcf9e8a52b20b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Liyue-Cheng/front-cpu/git/trees/8a99a70bfcdae2d513976f1c6a7fcf9e8a52b20b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Liyue-Cheng/front-cpu/git/commits/5846ba3da5898b7e0ea5694bedac91f97748d066","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127848794?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Liyue-Cheng","id":127848794,"login":"Liyue-Cheng","node_id":"U_kgDOB57RWg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Liyue-Cheng/front-cpu/commit/5846ba3da5898b7e0ea5694bedac91f97748d066","node_id":"C_kwDOQ7HOu9oAKDU4NDZiYTNkYTU4OThiN2UwZWE1Njk0YmVkYWM5MWY5Nzc0OGQwNjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Liyue-Cheng/front-cpu/commit/bd3e8811990c55af9cb8e77cdc170d8a42961550","sha":"bd3e8811990c55af9cb8e77cdc170d8a42961550","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Liyue-Cheng/front-cpu/commits/bd3e8811990c55af9cb8e77cdc170d8a42961550"}],"sha":"5846ba3da5898b7e0ea5694bedac91f97748d066","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Liyue-Cheng/front-cpu/commits/5846ba3da5898b7e0ea5694bedac91f97748d066"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127848794?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Liyue-Cheng","id":127848794,"login":"Liyue-Cheng","node_id":"U_kgDOB57RWg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Liyue-Cheng","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Liyue-Cheng/front-cpu/commits/bd3e8811990c55af9cb8e77cdc170d8a4296