date":"2026-07-03T12:31:08Z","email":"sanky369@gmail.com","name":"sanky369"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-03T12:31:08Z","email":"sanky369@gmail.com","name":"sanky369"},"message":"Rewrite product-design-review as an agent-operational procedure\n\nRebuild per docs/SKILL_SPEC.md: the skill now establishes an evidence\nmode first (rendered browser, computed-from-source, codebase, or static\nscreenshots) and tags every finding observed/computed/inferred, with\nseverity >= 2 requiring real evidence. Adds first-use and trust/dark-\npattern lenses, updates accessibility checks to WCAG 2.2 AA with real\nthresholds (4.5:1 contrast, 24px targets, focus-not-obscured), fixes the\nseverity rubric so uncertainty lowers confidence rather than severity,\nfolds the output template inline, and routes fix clusters to the\nfrontend-design skills that implement them. Verified via before/after\nsubagent runs on a flawed static checkout page and a live-URL review.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"940b7b385be972e948e524597b6f0cd154d24339","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanky369/vibe-building-skills/git/trees/940b7b385be972e948e524597b6f0cd154d24339"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanky369/vibe-building-skills/git/commits/554054c6208ab7bb9e6ee6f60cf3d4d996c7ab7e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11252952?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanky369/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanky369/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanky369/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanky369/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sanky369","id":11252952,"login":"sanky369","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjUyOTUy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanky369/orgs","received_eve