claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanky369/vibe-building-skills/commits/08217b249044fe06672f9e31ab2324d555d99fea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-02T15:06:31Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-02T15:06:31Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Align category READMEs with rewritten skills and fix stale claims\n\nRewrite the marketing, creative, and frontend-design category READMEs as\naccurate indexes of what each skill actually produces. The old creative README\ndescribed FLUX models and parameters (guidance scale, inference steps, pixel\nsizes) that the automation never supported — replaced with the real\nfal-ai/nano-banana-pro capabilities and honest limits. Marketing README''s\nwrong skill count (10 vs 12) and invented benchmark tables removed. Root\nREADME: correct positioning-angles framework count, list docs/SKILL_SPEC.md.\nAlso make the shared automation reference path fully qualified in brand-asset\nand product-photography.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014ScRnG2fc1E3qWAa8v3Tsi","tree":{"sha":"c988652267ccdca4078f18392dec4d1f33dbebcd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanky369/vibe-building-skills/git/trees/c988652267ccdca4078f18392dec4d1f33dbebcd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanky369/vibe-building-skills/git/commits/08217b249044fe06672f9e31ab2324d555d99fea","verification":{"payload":"tree c988652267ccdca4078f18392dec4d1f33dbebcd\nparent a7b9f5a9c5e78f852e58fc938e773ad596c18ae3\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783004791 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783004791 +0000\n\nAlign category READMEs with rewritten skills and fix stale claims\n\nRewrite the marketing, creative, and frontend-design category READMEs as\naccurate indexes of what each skill actually produces. The old creative README\ndescribed FLUX models and parameters (guidance scale, inference steps, pixel\nsizes) that the automation never supported — replaced with the real\nfal-ai/nano-banana-pro capabilities and honest limits. Marketing README''s\nwrong skill count (10 vs 12) and invented benchmark tables removed. Root\nREADME: correct positioning-angles framework count, list docs/SKILL_SPEC.md.\nAlso make the shared automation reference path fully qualified in brand-asset\nand product-photography.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014ScRnG2fc1E3qWAa8v3Tsi\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQC6Rgv4Y\noJYumygd82KnzSLr6Rzsc+5FaYr8uVkPsq4tQIJxsnmjMnwCWVh2yEsVuDI5djwMibXlh5hbqCkd\nJAU=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-02T15:06:33Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.