rational procedures\n\nRebuild component-architecture, interaction-physics, loading-states,\nerror-handling-recovery, performance-optimization, accessibility-excellence,\nand design-engineer-mindset per docs/SKILL_SPEC.md. Each skill now inspects\nthe user''s codebase first, decides via explicit forks (skeleton vs spinner by\nlatency, optimistic vs pessimistic by failure cost, native element vs ARIA\nretrofit), and produces code plus an audit artifact. Corrects stale metrics\n(FID replaced by INP; real CWV and WCAG 2.2 thresholds), drops the\nfake-progress pattern as dishonest, and moves code galleries to references/.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014ScRnG2fc1E3qWAa8v3Tsi","tree":{"sha":"7b35ac1bb9f9a17c62739825fabdf25b6ea69da8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanky369/vibe-building-skills/git/trees/7b35ac1bb9f9a17c62739825fabdf25b6ea69da8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanky369/vibe-building-skills/git/commits/a7b9f5a9c5e78f852e58fc938e773ad596c18ae3","verification":{"payload":"tree 7b35ac1bb9f9a17c62739825fabdf25b6ea69da8\nparent 12f8a09907ed7d0948187a2f377ca0c7d301c11a\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783004565 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783004565 +0000\n\nRewrite frontend batch B skills as agent-operational procedures\n\nRebuild component-architecture, interaction-physics, loading-states,\nerror-handling-recovery, performance-optimization, accessibility-excellence,\nand design-engineer-mindset per docs/SKILL_SPEC.md. Each skill now inspects\nthe user''s codebase first, decides via explicit forks (skeleton vs spinner by\nlatency, optimistic vs pessimistic by failure cost, native element vs ARIA\nretrofit), and produces code plus an audit artifact. Corrects stale metrics\n(FID replaced by INP; real CWV and WCAG 2.2 thresholds), drops the\nfake-progress pattern as dishonest, and moves code galleries to references/.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <n