 social-graphics, talking-head, and\nremotion-script-writer per docs/SKILL_SPEC.md, with targeted improvements to\nthe already-strong original-design skill (handoffs, required output format,\npath-based integration). Adds decision-rule tables, timed script rules,\nproduction-spec output templates, and verified CLI invocations; documents\nhonestly that the image model produces stills and renders text imperfectly.\nPreserves the remotion rules/ files with accurate when-to-read pointers.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014ScRnG2fc1E3qWAa8v3Tsi\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQOlyA2K/\n8D7PLpWKQDVjuVE6d1FWwDUTJ05k/msj5dkFQnjxWz73YvC+IGzoD/Wi4N7qsrdOWx8+jveodgFf\nIQY=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-02T14:58:15Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sanky369/vibe-building-skills/commit/1085bade569