 min to fix CRC CI 480000ms exceeded failures.\nUse BrokerApp binding secret host/port for mTLS jobs instead of hardcoded :61616.\nRename PKI secrets from activemq-artemis-manager-* to arkmq-org-broker-manager-* (CA mount fix on CRC CI).\nUpdate producer/consumer job image to arkmq-org-broker-kubernetes after operator rename.","tree":{"sha":"ddd47fe48e9f348b7351d719a62610c74c43d573","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkmq-org/arkmq-org-broker-operator-openshift-ui/git/trees/ddd47fe48e9f348b7351d719a62610c74c43d573"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkmq-org/arkmq-org-broker-operator-openshift-ui/git/commits/5d1bbfe948ef83834d9dc693d908510081d96501","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86971992?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lavocatt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lavocatt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lavocatt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lavocatt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lavocatt","id":86971992,"login":"lavocatt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2OTcxOTky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lavocatt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lavocatt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lavocatt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lavocatt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lavocatt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lavocatt","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/arkmq-org/arkmq-org-broker-operator-openshift-ui/commit/5d1bbfe948ef83834d9dc693d908510081d96501","node_id":"C_kwDOQ7Kl2toAKDVkMWJiZmU5NDhlZjgzODM0ZDlkYzY5M2Q5MDg1MTAwODFkOTY1MDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/arkmq-org/arkmq-org-broker-operator-openshift-ui/commit/28fc508bc026157c36677597e07536f04328a95e","sha":"28fc508bc026157c36677597e07536f04328a95e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkmq-org/arkmq-org-broker-operator-openshift-ui/commits/28fc508bc026157c36677597e07536f04328a95e"}],"sha":"5d1bbfe948ef83834d9dc693d908510081d96501","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkmq-org/arkmq-org-broker-operator-openshift-ui/commits/5d1bbfe948ef83834d9dc693d908510081d96501"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99248895?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Msarawan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Msarawan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Msarawan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Msarawan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Msarawan","id":99248895,"login":"Msarawan","node_id":"U_kgDOBepq_w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Msarawan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Msarawan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Msarawan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Msarawan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Msarawan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Msarawan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkmq-org/arkmq-org-broker-operator-openshift-ui/commits/28fc508bc026157c36677597e07536f04328a95e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-19T19:50:18Z","email":"msarawan@redhat.com","name":"Marjina Sarawan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T07:16:59Z","email":"86971992+lavocatt@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Thomas Lavocat"},"message":"[#29] Update outdated dependencies to align with console-plugin-template\n\nOur project was still using older dependencies (React 17 and related tooling). To stay aligned with upstream Console changes and avoid future incompatibilities,\ndependencies were updated to match the current Console setup.\n\nWhat was updated:\nUpdated React and related dependencies to match the versions used by the Console\n\nRemoved deprecated / unnecessary dependencies:\nreact-router-dom\nts-loader\n\nSwitched to:\nreact-router (covers required routing functionality)\nswc-loader (preferred over ts-loader for faster builds)\n\nConfiguration changes:\nUpdated webpack.config.ts to align with the upstream template\nUpdated tsconfig.json to match the updated build setup\nUpdated Dockerfile (nodejs-18 → nodejs-22, added network-timeout)\nAdded .swcrc for SWC automatic JSX runtime configuration\n\nESLint:\nRemoved legacy eslintrc.yml\nAdded eslint.config.mjs and migrated existing rules\n\nUpdated stylelintrc.yaml to stay compatible with the new setup\n\nValidation:\nAfter the updates, the following commands were executed successfully:\n\nyarn install\nyarn build\nyarn lint\nyarn i18n\n\nReference:\nUpstream: openshift/console-plugin-template#107","tree":{"sha":"96ad40343adfe08e1717ba3e2abe56934fc242c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkmq-org/arkmq-org-broker-operator-openshift-ui/git/trees/96ad40343adfe08e1717ba3e2abe56934fc242c7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkmq-org/arkmq-org-broker-operator-openshift-ui/git/commits/28fc508bc026157c36677597e07536f04328a95e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86971992?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lavocatt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lavocatt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lavocatt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lavocatt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lavocatt","id":86971992,"login":"lavocatt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2OTcxOTky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/l